null,"first":"Yuxiang","key":"zhengpau","last":"Zheng","name":"Zheng, Yuxiang","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Siyuan","key":"lipau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Siyuan","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"first":"Xiao","key":"liupau","last":"Liu","name":"Liu, Xiao","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5 6 7 8 9","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gregory Y. H.","key":"lippau","last":"Lip","locid":"8fa30e84-7381-41b4-8037-afc032238a3d","name":"Lip, Gregory Y H","name_org":"Lip, Gregory Y. H.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"10 11","corresponding":null,"first":"Linjuan","key":"guopau","last":"Guo","name":"Guo, Linjuan","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 12","corresponding":null,"first":"Wengen","key":"zhupau","last":"Zhu","name":"Zhu, Wengen","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1055/s-0043-1770724","issn":["03406245","03447618"],"issn_org":["03406245"],"issue":"2","journal":"Thrombosis and Haemostasis","pages":"166-177","publisher":"Georg Thieme Verlag","status":"p","title":"Thrombosis and Haemostasis","volume":"125"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85165239959"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-2fee007a-3008-4f66-b9ae-9a7d0f164d29"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Effect of Oral Anticoagulants in Atrial Fibrillation Patients with Polypharmacy: A Meta-analysis","type":"Journal Review","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-681717","year":"2025","yearsub":"2025"}
{"abstract":"Recent advancements in bio-electrochemical systems (BESs) for antibiotic removal are receiving great attentions due to the electro-active bacteria on the electrode that could elevate the removal efficiency. Enhanced detoxification performance of BESs compared to the traditional biological processes indicates the great potential serving as a sustainable alternative or a pre-/post-processing unit to improve the performance of biological processes. However, the successfully application of BESs to antibiotic-polluted water remediation requires a deeper discussion on their operational performance and emerging coupled systems. In order to address BESs as a practical option for antibiotic removal, we deeply analyze the detoxification mechanism of antibiotic treatment by BESs, involving BES fundamentals, extracellular electron transfer and degradation pathways via functional enzymes of microorganisms, followed by systematic evaluations of the operational conditions. Furthermore, the recently-emerged BESs combined with other techniques for practical applications has been summarized and emphasized. This review further directions the current limitations such as the potential risk of antibiotic resistance genes, etc., and prospects for the attenuation of antibiotics via BESs related techniques, promoting the development of practical application.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Tang, Jing","Li, Zijun","Xiao, Xinxin","Liu, Baicheng","Huang, Wei","Xie, Qingqing","Lan, Chenrui","Luo, Shuai","Tang, Lin"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-785894"],"filters":{"added":"2025-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"corresponding_author":["Tang, Jing","Tang, Lin"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Hunan Agricultural University","Hunan University","Shenyang Agricultural University"],"keyword":["Antibiotic removals","Bioelectrochemical systems","Combined systems","Mechanisms","Operational conditions"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Embargoed Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"recent advancements in antibiotics removal by bio electrochemical systems bess from mechanisms to application of emerging combined systems","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85207359620&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["The study was supported by the National Natural Science Foundation of China (No. 52100184 and U22A20917), the Hunan Provincial Natural Science Foundation of China (2022JJ40080). X.X. acknowledges a Novo Nordisk Foundation Start Package grant (0081331)."],"id":"S01-000.00-785894","identifier":[{"id":"85207359620","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-5c26fa7a-2410-4469-9728-26d66ab2b59d"],"keyword":["Antibiotic removals","Bioelectrochemical systems","Combined systems","Mechanisms","Operational conditions"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-0162916CB2BC5C31E4E688C545A540F6"],"oa_link":[{"access":"ea","embargo":"2026-10-30","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"loc","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"hunan university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Hunan University","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience, Section of Applied Supramolecular Chemistry","Aalborg University, [Mission] A Sustainable Danish Energy System"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"cn","key":"shenyang agricultural university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Shenyang Agricultural University","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"cn","key":"hunan agricultural university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Hunan Agricultural University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jing","key":"tangjingpau","last":"Tang","name":"Tang, Jing","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Zijun","key":"lizijunpau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Zijun","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Xinxin","key":"xiaoxinxinpau","last":"Xiao","locid":"fd69114c-9434-44ba-b01b-e9ecb3831cae","name":"Xiao, Xinxin","orcid":"0000-0002-0240-0038","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Baicheng","key":"liubaichengpau","last":"Liu","name":"Liu, Baicheng","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Wei","key":"huangweipau","last":"Huang","name":"Huang, Wei","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Qingqing","key":"xieqingqingpau","last":"Xie","name":"Xie, Qingqing","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Chenrui","key":"lanchenruipau","last":"Lan","name":"Lan, Chenrui","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Shuai","key":"luoshuaipau","last":"Luo","name":"Luo, Shuai","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lin","key":"tanglinpau","last":"Tang","name":"Tang, Lin","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.watres.2024.122683","issn":["00431354","18792448"],"issn_org":["00431354"],"issue":"Part B","journal":"Water Research","paperid":"122683","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Water Research","volume":"268"},"review":"Peer Reviewed