":"p","title":"Cancer Epidemiology, Biomarkers & Prevention","title_org":"Cancer Epidemiology Biomarkers and Prevention","volume":"33"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85186745004"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-7e1d2bb6-6e07-43ec-b06b-ab24689ae669"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Lung Cancer in Ever- and Never-Smokers : Findings from Multi-Population GWAS Studies","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-778178","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Real-time monitoring of health conditions is an emerging strong issue in health care, internet information, and other strongly evolving areas. Wearable electronics are versatile platforms for non-invasive sensing. Among a variety of wearable device principles, fiber electronics represent cutting-edge development of flexible electronics. Enabled by electrochemical sensing, fiber electronics have found a wide range of applications, providing new opportunities for real-time monitoring of health conditions by daily wearing, and electrochemical fiber sensors as explored in the present report are a promising emerging field. In consideration of the key challenges and corresponding solutions for electrochemical sensing fibers, we offer here a timely and comprehensive review. We discuss the principles and advantages of electrochemical sensing fibers and fabrics. Our review also highlights the importance of electrochemical sensing fibers in the fabrication of “smart” fabric designs, focusing on strategies to address key issues in fiber-based electrochemical sensors, and we provide an overview of smart clothing systems and their cutting-edge applications in therapeutic care. Our report offers a comprehensive overview of current developments in electrochemical sensing fibers to researchers in the fields of wearables, flexible electronics, and electrochemical sensing, stimulating forthcoming development of next-generation “smart” fabrics-based electrochemical sensing.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Tian, Hang","Ma, Junlin","Li, Yaogang","Xiao, Xinxin","Zhang, Minwei","Wang, Hongzhi","Zhu, Nan","Hou, Chengyi","Ulstrup, Jens"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-703768"],"filters":{"added":"2024-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Asia, East"],"corresponding_author":["Hou, Chengyi","Li, Yaogang","Ulstrup, Jens","Xiao, Xinxin","Zhu, Nan"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Dalian University of Technology","Donghua University","Xinjiang University"],"keyword":["Electrochemical sensing","Fabric sensors","Flexible electronics","Smart clothing","Wearable electronics"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"electrochemical sensing fibers for wearable health monitoring devices","src":["aau","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"djr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85178554104&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["This work was supported by the National Natural Science Foundation of China (No. 22211530046 , No. 22074010 and No. 52073057 ), DHU Distinguished Young Professor Program ( LZA2023001 ). X.X. acknowledges a Villum Experiment (grant No. 35844 ) and a Novo Nordisk Foundation Start Package grant ( 0081331 )."],"id":"S02-100.00-703768","identifier":[{"id":"38048721","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85178554104","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-a16c53ad-b61f-4eda-a56b-e74e35b27149","dtu-300f89b0-87b0-4e24-b96e-f9e054840f1d"],"keyword":["Electrochemical sensing","Fabric sensors","Flexible electronics","Smart clothing","Wearable electronics"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-DD6B725723E347C862B2BD0E8D58F273"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"donghua university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Donghua University","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"cn","key":"dalian university of technology","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Dalian University of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"