,"key":"raoweiqiaopau","last":"Rao","name":"Rao, Weiqiao","rank":16,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Yan","key":"renyanpau","last":"Ren","name":"Ren, Yan","rank":17,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Yuan","key":"wangyuanpau","last":"Wang","name":"Wang, Yuan","rank":18,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Jin","key":"zijinpau","last":"Zi","name":"Zi, Jin","rank":19,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Rong","key":"wangrongpau","last":"Wang","name":"Wang, Rong","rank":20,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Xun","key":"xuxunpau","last":"Xu","name":"Xu, Xun","rank":21,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 5","first":"Huanming","key":"yanghuanmingpau","last":"Yang","name":"Yang, Huanming","rank":22,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 5","first":"Jian","key":"wangjianpau","last":"Wang","name":"Wang, Jian","rank":23,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Yang","key":"zongyangpau","last":"Zong","name":"Zong, Yang","rank":24,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Weibin","key":"liuweibinpau","last":"Liu","name":"Liu, Weibin","rank":25,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Yong","key":"houyongpau","last":"Hou","name":"Hou, Yong","rank":26,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Xin","key":"jinxinpau","last":"Jin","name":"Jin, Xin","rank":27,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Liang","key":"xiaoliangpau","last":"Xiao","name":"Xiao, Liang","rank":28,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","first":"Karsten","key":"kristiansenkarstenpau","last":"Kristiansen","locid":"941041b1-1b8f-4be5-9a65-5e98f662c07e","name":"Kristiansen, Karsten","orcid":"0000-0002-6024-0917","rank":29,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Huijue","key":"jiahuijuepau","last":"Jia","name":"Jia, Huijue","rank":30,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","first":"Tao","key":"zhangtaopau","last":"Zhang","locid":"0f461257-e509-4c74-b583-4524ba48a973","name":"Zhang, Tao","rank":31,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["36660475"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.isci.2022.105839","issn":["25890042"],"issue":"1","journal":"iScience","paperid":"105839","status":"p","title":"iScience","volume":"26"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85146072275"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-72bf8629-e292-4b66-94dd-298bbe8fadb0"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Sex differences in the oral microbiome, host traits, and their causal relationships","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-462001","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Background: Respiratory syncytial virus (RSV) imposes a substantial burden on pediatric hospital capacity in Europe. Promising prophylactic interventions against RSV including monoclonal antibodies (mAb) and maternal immunizations (MI) are close to licensure. Therefore, we aimed to evaluate the cost-effectiveness of potential mAb and MI interventions against RSV in infants, for six European countries. Methods: We used a static cohort model to compare costs and health effects of four intervention programs to no program and to each other: year-round MI, year-round mAb, seasonal mAb (October to April), and seasonal mAb plus a catch-up program in October. Input parameters were obtained from national registries and literature. Influential input parameters were identified with the expected value of partial perfect information and extensive scenario analyses (including the impact of interventions on wheezing and asthma). Results: From the health care payer perspective, and at a price of €50 per dose (mAb and MI), seasonal mAb plus catch-up was cost-saving in Scotland, and cost-effective for willingness-to-pay (WTP) values ≥€20,000 (England, Finland) or €30,000 (Denmark) per quality adjusted life-year (QALY) gained for all scenarios considered, except when using ICD-10 based hospitalization data. For the Netherlands, seasonal mAb was preferred (WTP value: €30,000-€90,000) for most scenarios. For Veneto region (Italy), either seasonal mAb with or without catch-up or MI was preferred, depending on the scenario and WTP value. From a full societal perspective (including leisure time lost), the seasonal mAb plus catch-up program was cost-saving for all countries except the Netherlands. Conclusion: The choice between a MI or mAb program depends on the level and duration of protection, price, availability, and feasibility of such programs, which should be based on the latest available evidence. Future research should focus on measuring accurately age-specific RSV-attributable hospitalizations in very young children.","author_count":18,"contributors":["Getaneh, Abraham","Li, Xiao","Mao, Zhuxin","Klint Johannesen, Caroline","Barbieri, Elisa","van Summeren, Jojanneke","Wang, Xin","Tong, Sabine","Baraldi, Eugenio","Phijffer, Emily","Rizzo, Caterina","van Wijhe, Maarten","Heikkinen, Terho","Bont, Louis","Willem, Lander","Jit, Mark","Beutels, Philippe","Bilcke, Joke"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-566564"],"filters":{"added":"2023-05","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Belgium","China","Finland","France","Italy","Netherlands","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","London School & Hygiene and Tropical Medicine","Nanjing Medical University","Nivel","Sanofi Pasteur","Universita degli Studi di Pisa","University Medical Center Utrecht","University of Antwerp","University of Edinburgh","University of Padova","University of Turku"],"keyword":["Cost effectiveness analysis","Disease burden","Monoclonal antibody","Perspective","expected value of partial perfect information EVPPI","expected value of perfect information EVPI","maternal immunization","respiratory syncytial virus RSV","seasonal program"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-SSI"],"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-SSI","DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"cost effectiveness of monoclonal antibody and maternal immunization against respiratory syncytial virus rsv in infants evaluation for six european countries","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/91183514/SSRN_id4238646.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-566564","identifier":[{"id":"85147590318","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ruc-9d0687b0-6956-4fb1-ac57-8279c2235e36"],"keyword":["cost-effectiveness analysis","disease burden","expected value of partial perfect information (EVPPI)","expected value of perfect information (EVPI)","maternal immunization","monoclonal antibody","perspective","respiratory syncytial virus (RSV)","seasonal program"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-6A3D61D441463215610CBCC2C211B354"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/91183514/SSRN_id4238646.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"be","key":"university of antwerp","loc":["Belgium","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Antwerp","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ssi statens serum institut","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-SSI","l3nn":"SSI Statens Serum Institut","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SSI Statens Serum Institut","namevar":["Statens Serum Institut"],"nora_code":"DI-GV-SSI","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - North Zealand"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"it","key":"university of padova","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Padova","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"nl","key":"nivel","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Nivel","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"cn","key":"nanjing medical university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Nanjing Medical University","used":1},{"affno":"7","country":"gb","key":"university of edinburgh","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Edinburgh","used":1},{"affno":"8","country":"fr","key":