{"abstract":"We present an interlayer exciton laser composed of a MoS2/WSe2 heterostructure integrated with a silicon photonic topological microcavity with a quality factor of up to 104. We achieve excitonic lasing with ultra-low threshold, high side-mode suppression ratio and the longest emission wavelength to the telecommunication O-band.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Lin, Qiaoling","Fang, Hanlin","Liu, Yuanda","Zhang, Yi","Fischer, Moritz","Li, Juntao","Stenger, Nicolas","Sun, Zhipei","Wubs, Martijn","Xiao, Sanshui"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-711882"],"event":{"end":"2023-07-21","place":"Paris, fr","start":"2023-07-18","title":"13<sup>th</sup> International Conference on Metamaterials, Photonic Crystals and Plasmonics","year":"2023"},"filters":{"added":"2024-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East","Asia, South","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Xiao, Sanshui"],"country":["China","Finland","Singapore","Sweden"],"glorg":["Aalto University","Agency for Science, Technology and Research, Singapore","All Global Affiliations","Chalmers University of Technology","Sun Yat-Sen University"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"interlayer exciton lasing in atomically thin heterostructures","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-711882","identifier":[{"id":"85174607617","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-ac0144bc-556b-4873-976e-e07bcf45e3f8"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-9B0105CF96DDDF2FF30B5BFFD0823326"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical and Photonics Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical and Photonics Engineering, Quantum Photonics of Low-dimensional Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"se","key":"chalmers university of technology","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Chalmers University of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"sg","key":"agency for science technology and research singapore","loc":["Singapore","Asia, South"],"name":"Agency for Science, Technology and Research, Singapore","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"fi","key":"aalto university","loc":["Finland","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Aalto University","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"cn","key":"sun yat sen university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Sun Yat-Sen University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Qiaoling","key":"linpau","last":"Lin","locid":"328f792c-6f4a-4472-9fff-ba9b2ae4a178","name":"Lin, Qiaoling","orcid":"0000-0003-1633-0293","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Hanlin","key":"fangpau","last":"Fang","name":"Fang, Hanlin","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Yuanda","key":"liupau","last":"Liu","name":"Liu, Yuanda","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Yi","key":"zhangpau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Yi","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Moritz","key":"fischerpau","last":"Fischer","locid":"9b0f369b-eccb-4e6e-a254-5f1ed7503fd5","name":"Fischer, Moritz","orcid":"0000-0002-5904-9672","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Juntao","key":"lipau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Juntao","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Nicolas","key":"stengerpau","last":"Stenger","locid":"b458470c-3f7f-4b44-a269-eb6e3007c2fe","name":"Stenger, Nicolas","orcid":"0000-0002-6808-9211","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Zhipei","key":"sunpau","last":"Sun","name":"Sun, Zhipei","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Martijn","key":"wubspau","last":"Wubs","locid":"a6e58ad6-f065-4d18-8080-527891c76077","name":"Wubs, Martijn","orcid":"0000-0002-8286-7825","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Sanshui","key":"xiaopau","last":"Xiao","locid":"c516dded-c5eb-40a6-b2dd-37be55b893c8","name":"Xiao, Sanshui","orcid":"0000-0001-6529-5047","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-ac0144bc-556b-4873-976e-e07bcf45e3f8"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Interlayer Exciton Lasing in Atomically Thin Heterostructures","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-711882","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"The Global Consortium for the Classification of Fungi and fungus-like taxa is an international initiative of more than 550 mycologists to develop an electronic structure for the classification of these organisms. The members of the Consortium originate from 55 countries/regions worldwide, from a wide range of disciplines, and include senior, mid-career and early-career mycologists and plant pathologists. The Consortium will publish a biannual update of the Outline of Fungi and fungus-like taxa, to act as an international scheme for other scientists. Notes on all newly published taxa at or above the level of species will be prepared and published online on the Outline of Fungi website (https://www.outlineoffungi.org/), and these will be finally published in the biannual edition of the Outline of Fungi and fungus-like taxa. Comments on recent important taxonomic opinions on controversial topics will be included in the biannual outline. For example, 'to promote a more stable taxonomy in Fusarium given the divergences over its generic delimitation', or 'are there too many genera in the Boletales?' and even more importantly, 'what should be done with the tremendously diverse 'dark fungal taxa?' There are undeniable differences in mycologists' perceptions and opinions regarding species classification as well as the establishment of new species. Given the pluralistic nature of fungal taxonomy and its implications for species concepts and the nature of species, this consortium aims to provide a platform to better refine and stabilise fungal classification, taking into consideration views from different parties. In the future, a confidential voting system will be set up to gauge the opinions of all mycologists in the Consortium on important topics. The results of such surveys will be presented to the International Commission on the Taxonomy of Fungi (ICTF) and the Nomenclature Committee for Fungi (NCF) with opinions and percentages of votes for and against. Criticisms based on scientific evidence with regards to nomenclature, classifications, and taxonomic concepts will be welcomed, and any recommendations on specific taxonomic issues will also be encouraged; however, we will encourage professionally and ethically responsible criticisms of others' work. This biannual ongoing project will provide an outlet for advances in various topics of fungal classification, nomenclature, and taxonomic concepts and lead to a community-agreed classification scheme for the fungi and fungus-like taxa. Interested parties should contact the lead author if they would like to be involved in future outlines.","author_count":544,"contributors":["Hyde, K. D.","Abdel-Wahab, M. A.","Abdollahzadeh, J.","Abeywickrama, P. D.","Absalan, S.","Afshari, N.","Ainsworth, A. M.","Akulov, O. Y.","Aleoshin, V. V.","Al-Sadi, A. M.","Alvarado, P.","Alves, A.","Alves-Silva, G.","Amalfi, M.","Amira, Y.","Amuhenage, T. B.","Anderson, J. L.","Antonín, V.","Aouali, S.","Aptroot, A.","Apurillo, C. C. S.","Araújo, J. P.M.","Ariyawansa, H. A.","Armand, A.","Arumugam, E.","Asghari, R.","Assis, D. M.A.","Atienza, V.","Avasthi, S.","Azevedo, E.","Bahkali, A. H.","Bakhshi, M.","Banihashemi, Z.","Bao, D. F.","Baral, H. O.","Barata, M.","Barbosa, F. R.","Barbosa, R. N.","Barreto, R. W.","Baschien, C.","Belamesiatseva, D. B.","Reuel, M. Bennett","Bera, I.","Bezerra, J. D. P.","Bezerra, J. L.","Bhat, D. J.","Bhunjun, C. S.","Bianchinotti, M. V.","Błaszkowski, J.","Blondelle, A.","Boekhout, T.","Bonito, G.","Boonmee, S.","Boonyuen, N.","Bregant, C.","Buchanan, P.","Bundhun, D.","Burgaud, G.","Burgess, T.","Buyck, B.","Cabarroi-Hernández, M.","Cáceres, M. E. S.","Caeiro, M. F.","Cai, L.","Cai, M. F.","Calabon, M. S.","Calaça, F. J. S.","Callalli, M.","Camara, M. P. S.","Cano-Lira, J. F.","Cantillo, T.","Cao, B.","Carlavilla, J. R.","Carvalho, A.","Castañeda-Ruiz, R. F.","Castlebury, L.","Castro-Jauregui, O.","Catania, M. D.","Cavalcanti, L. H.","Cazabonne, J.","Cedeño-Sanchez, M.