{"abstract":"Biochar synthesized from algal biomasses acts as an efficient adsorbent to remove tetracycline (TC) from aqueous solutions. In this study, a mixture of Enteromorpha (EN) and Chlorella vulgaris (CV) was pyrolyzed at 500 °C, then activated with NaOH at 800 °C to prepare composite biochar (ECA-B). The effects of TC concentration (50–500 mg·L−1), pH (3–11), temperature (30 °C–50 °C), and contact time (0–960 min) on TC absorption were investigated. Results revealed that in aqueous solutions, the biochar (EC4:1-0.5)prepared with CV and EN at the mass ratio of 4:1 and the impregnation ratio of 0.5 had the optimal TC adsorption capacity (Qm = 376.878 mg·g−1). The removal rate of EC4:1-0.5 remained above 80 % after five cycles. The surface area of EC4:1-0.5 (583.329 m2·g−1) increased by three and four times that of EN and CV, respectively. Intraparticle diffusion was considered as the major limitation for the adsorption of TC onto EC4:1-0.5. This investigation provides a method for the synthesis and optimization of algal biomass-based activated carbon for the absorption of organic pollutants in wastewater.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Xu, Shannan","Yang, Jingwen","Marrakchi, Fatma","Wei, Manman","Liu, Yong","Xiao, Yayuan","Li, Chunhou","Wang, Shuang"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-756354"],"filters":{"added":"2024-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"corresponding_author":["Liu, Yong","Wang, Shuang"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Jiangsu University","Ministry of Agriculture of the People's Republic of China"],"keyword":["Adsorption capacity","Algal biomass","Biochar","Surface area","Tetracycline"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"macro and micro algae based carbon composite for pharmaceutical wastewater treatment batch adsorption and mechanism study","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85163211114&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-756354","identifier":[{"id":"85163211114","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-05dd2574-5adb-43bc-878c-24ce89e0598b"],"keyword":["Adsorption capacity","Algal biomass","Biochar","Composite activated carbon","Surface area","Tetracycline"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-3722BA70EB6B0819424780BD395326C9"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"ministry of agriculture of the people s republic of china","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Ministry of Agriculture of the People's Republic of China","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"cn","key":"jiangsu university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Jiangsu University","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Thermal Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Shannan","key":"xupau","last":"Xu","name":"Xu, Shannan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jingwen","key":"yangpau","last":"Yang","name":"Yang, Jingwen","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Fatma","key":"marrakchipau","last":"Marrakchi","locid":"5ec51c98-999f-4815-acaa-cbd6563231d9","name":"Marrakchi, Fatma","orcid":"0000-0002-4633-1687","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Manman","key":"weipau","last":"Wei","name":"Wei, Manman","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Yong","key":"liupau","last":"Liu","name":"Liu, Yong","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Yayuan","key":"xiaopau","last":"Xiao","name":"Xiao, Yayuan","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Chunhou","key":"lipau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Chunhou","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Shuang","key":"wangpau","last":"Wang","name":"Wang, Shuang","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.psep.2023.06.020","issn":["09575820","17443598"],"issn_org":["09575820"],"journal":"Process Safety and Environmental Protection","pages":"641-652","publisher":"Institution of Chemical Engineers","status":"p","title":"Process Safety and Environmental Protection","volume":"176"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85163211114"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-05dd2574-5adb-43bc-878c-24ce89e0598b"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Macro- and micro-algae-based carbon composite for pharmaceutical wastewater treatment : Batch adsorption and mechanism study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-756354","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Energy losses during the conversion and supply of electric power are considered a significant issue and cannot be estimated. Improvement in the efficiency of energy conversion systems is highly restricted because of their internal nonlinearity and complexity. Thus, inspired by the successful utilization of robotic chemists, we demonstrate a pioneering concept of artificial intelligence (AI)-aided automatic online real-time optimization of a power electronics converter using a dual active bridge (DAB) converter as an example. An optimal modulation strategy was obtained through repeated automatic exploration experiments on a practical DAB converter platform. Specifically, the DAB experimental platform operated autonomously around the clock for approximately 71 h. It performed 120,000 consecutive experiments (12,000 episodes) within a six-variable experimental space driven by a deep deterministic policy gradient (DDPG) algorithm. The proposed AI-aided automatic online real-time optimization method achieved significantly improved efficiency of power conversion and supply. Consequently, zero carbon emissions may be obtained in the future.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Tang, Yuanhong","Cao, Di","Xiao, Jian","Jiang, Chenying","Huang, Qi","Li, Yunwei","Chen, Zhe","Blaabjerg, Frede","Hu, Weihao"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-786221"],"filters":{"added":"2025-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Asia, East","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Hu, Weihao"],"country":["Canada","China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Mornsun Guangzhou Science & Technology Co. Ltd.","Sichuan Provincial Key Laboratory of Power System Wide Area Measurement and Control","Southwest University of Science and Technology","Tsinghua University","University of Alberta","University of Electronic Science and Technology of China"],"keyword":["Artificial intelligence","DC DC converter","Dual active bridge converter","Energy conversion system","Power electronics"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"ai aided power electronic converters automatic online real time efficiency optimization method","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fmre.2023.05.004","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-786221","identifier":[{"id":"85163118700","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-af438dc4-3726-4680-a2ec-b666605a7e5a"],"keyword":["Artificial intelligence","Automatic online real-time exploration","DC-DC converter","Dual active bridge converter","Energy conversion system","Power electronics"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-FBF6C05598416E4DAE4A6FD29534C702"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fmre.2023.05.004","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"university of electronic science and technology of china","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"University of Electronic Science and Technology of China","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"cn","key":"mornsun guangzhou science technology co ltd","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Mornsun Guangzhou Science & Technology Co. Ltd.","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"cn","key":"tsinghua university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Tsinghua University","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"cn","key":"southwest university of science and technology","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Southwest University of Science and Technology","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"ca","key":"university of alberta","loc":["Canada","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of Alberta","used":1},{"affno":"6","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3