 and Electronics Engineers)","status":"p","title":"IEEE Journal of Emerging and Selected Topics in Power Electronics","title_org":"I E E E Journal of Emerging and Selected Topics in Power Electronics","volume":"10"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85104173219"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-5928d642-44f4-4e10-8345-0edbce6e3a93"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"RL-ANN-Based Minimum-Current-Stress Scheme for the Dual-Active-Bridge Converter With Triple-Phase-Shift Control","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-075899","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"The SoccerNet 2022 challenges were the second annual video understanding challenges organized by the SoccerNet team. In 2022, the challenges were composed of 6 vision-based tasks: (1) action spotting, focusing on retrieving action timestamps in long untrimmed videos, (2) replay grounding, focusing on retrieving the live moment of an action shown in a replay, (3) pitch localization, focusing on detecting line and goal part elements, (4) camera calibration, dedicated to retrieving the intrinsic and extrinsic camera parameters, (5) player re-identification, focusing on retrieving the same players across multiple views, and (6) multiple object tracking, focusing on tracking players and the ball through unedited video streams. Compared to last year's challenges, tasks (1-2) had their evaluation metrics redefined to consider tighter temporal accuracies, and tasks (3-6) were novel, including their underlying data and annotations. More information on the tasks, challenges and leaderboards are available on https://www.soccer-net.org. Baselines and development kits are available on https://github.com/SoccerNet.","author_count":94,"contributors":["Giancola, Silvio","Cioppa, Anthony","Deliège, Adrien","Magera, Floriane","Somers, Vladimir","Kang, Le","Zhou, Xin","Barnich, Olivier","De Vleeschouwer, Christophe","Alahi, Alexandre","Ghanem, Bernard","Van Droogenbroeck, Marc","Darwish, Abdulrahman","Maglo, Adrien","Clapés, Albert","Luyts, Andreas","Boiarov, Andrei","Xarles, Artur","Orcesi, Astrid","Shah, Avijit","Fan, Baoyu","Comandur, Bharath","Chen, Chen","Zhang, Chen","Zhao, Chen","Lin, Chengzhi","Chan, Cheuk Yiu","Hui, Chun Chuen","Li, Dengjie","Yang, Fan","Liang, Fan","Da, Fang","Yan, Feng","Yu, Fufu","Wang, Guanshuo","Chan, H. Anthony","Zhu, He","Kan, Hongwei","Chu, Jiaming","Hu, Jianming","Gu, Jianyang","Chen, Jin","Soares, João V.B.","Theiner, Jonas","De Corte, Jorge","Brito, José Henrique","Zhang, Jun","Li, Junjie","Liang, Junwei","Shen, Leqi","Ma, Lin","Chen, Lingchi","Santos Marques, Miguel","Azatov, Mike","Kasatkin, Nikita","Wang, Ning","Jia, Qiong","Pham, Quoc Cuong","Ewerth, Ralph","Song, Ran","Li, Rengang","Gade, Rikke","Debien, Ruben","Zhang, Runze","Lee, Sangrok","Escalera, Sergio","Jiang, Shan","Odashima, Shigeyuki","Chen, Shimin","Masui, Shoichi","Ding, Shouhong","Chan, Sin Wai","Chen, Siyu","El-Shabrawy, Tallal","He, Tao","Moeslund, Thomas B.","Siu, Wan Chi","Zhang, Wei","Li, Wei","Wang, Xiangwei","Tan, Xiao","Li, Xiaochuan","Wei, Xiaolin","Ye, Xiaoqing","Liu, Xing","Wang, Xinying","Guo, Yandong","Zhao, Yaqian","Yu, Yi","Li, Yingying","He, Yue","Zhong, Yujie","Guo, Zhenhua","Li, Zhiheng"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-090974"],"event":{"end":"2022-10-14","place":"Lisboa, pt","start":"2022-10-14","title":"5th ACM International Workshop on Multimedia Content Analysis in Sports, MMSports 2022, co-located with ACM Multimedia 2022","year":"2022"},"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"51-200 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Africa","America, North","Asia, East","Asia, Middle East","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["Belgium","China","Egypt","France","Germany","Hong Kong","Japan","Portugal","Saudi Arabia","South Korea","Spain","Switzerland","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Arsenal FC","Baidu Inc","Beijing University of Posts and Telecommunications","Caritas Institute of Higher Education","ComUE Paris-Saclay","EVS Broadcast Equipment","East China University of Science and Technology","Fujitsu","German University in Cairo","Guangdong OPPO Mobile Telecommunications Corp. Ltd.","Hong Kong Polytechnic University","Hunan Broadcasting System","Inspur Electronic Information Industry Co. Ltd.","Instituto Politécnico do Cávado e do Ave","King Abdullah University of Science and Technology","Leibniz University Hannover","Meituan","Purdue University","QCraft Inc.","ReBatch","Schaffhausen Institute of Technology","Shandong University","Sun Yat-Sen University","Swiss Federal Institute of Technology Lausanne","Tencent","Tsinghua University","University of Barcelona","University of Liege","Université catholique de Louvain","Yahoo Research Labs","Yonsei University","Zhejiang University"],"keyword":["Challenges","Computer vision","Datasets","Neural networks","Soccer","Video understanding"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"soccernet 000000002022 challenges results","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3552437.3558545","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["This work was supported by the Service Public de Wallonie (SPW) Recherche under the DeepSport project and Grant No. 2010235 (ARIAC by https://DigitalWallonia4.ai), the FRIA, the FNRS, and KAUST Oce of Sponsored Research through the Visual Computing Center funding."],"id":"S01-000.00-090974","identifier":[{"id":"85137720519","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-8cd46d23-52fd-46da-9424-97a63c35fa14"],"keyword":["challenges","computer vision","datasets","neural networks","soccer","video understanding"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-5392472D53F6AA683D16FA94FABBCE09"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3552437.3558545","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/519305482/3552437.3558545.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"sa","key":"king abdullah university of science and technology","loc":["Saudi Arabia","Asia, Middle East"],"name":"King Abdullah University of Science and Technology","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"be","key":"un