{"abstract":"A tri-band dual-polarized shared-aperture antenna module with easy-to-assemble and compact size characteristics by integrating magneto-electric dipole into electric dipoles is proposed in this paper. The complete antenna module consists of three parts. The first part is a low-band (LB) dual-polarized antenna unit employing two pairs of folded dipoles operating from 0.82 GHz to 0.99 GHz. The second part is a middle-band (MB) antenna unit working in the band of 1.7-2.2 GHz in the form of pairs of magnetic dipoles. The last part is a high-band (HB) antenna unit with a pair of cross-dipole that covers bandwidth from 3.3 GHz to 3.6 GHz. Combining the advantages of the three antenna units, the proposed trip-band antenna module shows good radiation performance for wideband application.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Li, Xiao-Dong","Zhang, Zhong-Qi","Chen, Min","Liu, Hao-Lei","Huang, Guan-Long","Fan, Wei","Sim, Chow-Yen-Desmond"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-673727"],"event":{"end":"2022-12-18","place":"Haidian, China","start":"2022-12-17","title":"2022 Cross Strait Radio Science &amp; Wireless Technology Conference (CSRSWTC)","year":"2022"},"filters":{"added":"2023-07","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"country":["China","Taiwan"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Feng Chia University","Foshan University"],"keyword":["5G mobile communication","Broadband antennas","Dipole antennas","Electromagnetics","Wideband","Wireless communication"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a compact shared aperture tri band dual polarized antenna module","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/10098460/","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-673727","identifier":[{"id":"85156133917","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-69c21f0c-6bcf-4c60-a253-cc2c4880c151"],"keyword":["5G mobile communication","Broadband antennas","Dipole antennas","Electromagnetics","Magnetoelectric effects","Wideband","Wireless communication"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-9387E6F814E9975A44CB16C6DD83948E"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"foshan university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Foshan University","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Antennas, Propagation and Millimetre-Wave Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Wireless propagation and Over the Air testing"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"tw","key":"feng chia university","loc":["Taiwan","Asia, East"],"name":"Feng Chia University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Xiao-Dong","key":"lipau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Xiao-Dong","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Zhong-Qi","key":"zhangpau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Zhong-Qi","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Min","key":"chenpau","last":"Chen","name":"Chen, Min","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hao-Lei","key":"liupau","last":"Liu","name":"Liu, Hao-Lei","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Guan-Long","key":"huangpau","last":"Huang","name":"Huang, Guan-Long","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Wei","key":"fanpau","last":"Fan","locid":"196e035b-e3db-4c94-b288-03dcd3119fda","name":"Fan, Wei","orcid":"0000-0002-9835-4485","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Chow-Yen-Desmond","key":"simpau","last":"Sim","name":"Sim, Chow-Yen-Desmond","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/csrswtc56224.2022.10098460","isbn":["9781665460972"],"issn":["23778512"],"pages":"1-3","publisher":"IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers)","series":"Cross Strait Quad-Regional Radio Science and Wireless Technology Conference","status":"p","title":"2022 Cross Strait Radio Science &amp; Wireless Technology Conference (CSRSWTC)"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85156133917"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-69c21f0c-6bcf-4c60-a253-cc2c4880c151"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"A Compact Shared-Aperture Tri-Band Dual-Polarized Antenna Module","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-673727","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"With the development of clean energy systems, large-scale renewable energy is being connected to the traditional distribution network, which also brings new challenges to the reliable and economic scheduling of the power grid. To address these challenges, this paper proposes an intelligent scheduling strategy for a wind energy dominated distribution network, which aims to reduce the fluctuation caused by the wind energy. First, the energy scheduling model and objective function of the distribution network system are established and the constraints of various types of components are considered. Then, deep reinforcement learning is introduced to realize real-time decision in distribution network to solve the problem of fluctuation caused by the uncertain wind power output. The energy scheduling method is developed into a Markov decision process based on deep deterministic policy gradient (DDPG) algorithm. Finally, the simulation is verified on the IEEE14 node system. The results verify that the proposed approach can effectively reduce power fluctuations in the distribution network. The superiority of the adopted DDPG algorithm is demonstrated by comparing with the deep Q network algorithm.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Zhu, Jiaoyiling","Hu, Weihao","Xu, Xiao","Liu, Haoming","Pan, Li","Fan, Haoyang","Zhang, Zhenyuan","Chen, Zhe"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-100668"],"filters":{"added":"2023-05","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"corresponding_author":["Hu, Weihao"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Sichuan University","University of Electronic Science and Technology of China"],"keyword":["Deep reinforcement learning","Distribution network","Optimal scheduling","Wind energy"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"optimal scheduling of a wind energy dominated distribution network via a deep reinforcement learning approach","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85141746057&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["This work was supported by the National Key Research and Development Program of China ( 2018YFE0127600 )."],"id":"S01-000.00-100668","identifier":[{"id":"85141746057","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-ae6a713a-2fca-4e5c-99de-557205baf268"],"keyword":["Deep reinforcement learning","Distribution network","Optimal scheduling","Wind energy"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-376684B4F9211D382510F947C5DA0BBF"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"university of electronic science and technology of china","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"University of Electronic Science and Technology of China","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"cn","key":"sichuan university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Sichuan University","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Electric Power Systems and Microgrids","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Intelligent Energy Systems and Flexible Markets","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Wind Power Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jiaoyiling","key":"zhupau","last":"Zhu","name":"Zhu, Jiaoyiling","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Weihao","key":"hupau","last":"Hu","name":"Hu, Weihao","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Xiao","key":"xupau","last":"Xu","name":"Xu, Xiao","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Haoming","key":"liupau","last":"Liu","name":"Liu, Haoming","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Li","key":"panpau","last":"Pan","name":"Pan, Li","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Haoyang","key":"fanpau","last":"Fan","name":"Fan, Haoyang","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Zhenyuan","key":"zhangpau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Zhenyuan","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Zhe","key":"chenpau","last":"Chen","locid":"d823b80a-ad7f-4339-b75a-8dee8403f02a","name":"Chen, Zhe","orcid":"0000-0002-2919-4481","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.renene.2022.10.094","issn":["09601481","18790682"],"issn_org":["09601481"],"issue":"Part 1","journal":"Renewable Energy","pages":"792-801","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Renewable Energy","volume":"201"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85141746057"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-ae6a713a-2fca-4e5c-99de-557205baf268"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Optimal scheduling of a wind energy dominated distribution network via a deep reinforcement learning approach","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-100668","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"Secchi disk depth (SDD) is a simple but particularly important indicator for characterizing the overall water quality status and assessing the long-term dynamics of water quality for diverse global waters. For this reason, countless efforts have been made to collect SDD data from the field and through remote sensing systems. Many empirical and semianalytical algorithms have been proposed to estimate SDD from different satellite images for a specific or regional water. However, the construction of a robust global SDD estimation model is still challenging due to the nonlinear response of SDD to optical properties and the complex physical and biogeochemical processes of different waters. Therefore, machine learning methods to better interpret nonlinear processes were used to improve remote sensing estimations of SDD for global lakes and reservoirs based on a global matchup dataset from Landsat TM (N = 4099), ETM+ (N = 2420), and OLI (N = 1249) covering in situ SDD from 0.01 m to over 18 m. Overall, extreme gradient boosting (XGBoost) and random forest (RF) had better SDD retrievals than back propagation neural network, support vector regression, empirical and quasi-analytical models showing high precision with mean relative error of approximately 30% and good agreements with the long-term in situ SDD in different waters with various optical properties. Our results can support long-term global-level water quality evaluation and thus making informed decisions about development policy.","author_count":15,"contributors":["Zhang, Yibo","Shi, Kun","Sun, Xiao","Zhang, Yunlin","Li, Na","Wang, Weijia","Zhou, Yongqiang","Wei, Zhi","Liu, Mingliang","Li, Yuan","Zhu, Guangwei","Qin, Boqiang","Jeppesen, Erik","Zhou, Jian","Li, Huiyun"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-230115"],"filters":{"added":"2022-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Asia, East","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Zhang, Yunlin"],"country":["China","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","CAS - Nanjing Institute of Geography and Limnology","Chinese Academy of Sciences","Pennsylvania State University","University of Chinese Academy of Sciences","Zhejiang Gongshang University"],"keyword":["Global lakes","Random forest","Reservoirs","Water clarity","XGBoost"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"improving remote sensing estimation of secchi disk depth for global lakes and reservoirs using machine learning methods","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1080/15481603.2022.2116102","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-230115","identifier":[{"id":"000845016800001","type":"wos"},{"id":"85136728296","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-b0a352d3-aa76-4949-8d63-350290b2a86c"],"keyword":["Global lakes","XGBoost","random forest","reservoirs","water clarity"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-FF7197B7A68664A3198C35C37FA84BCE"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1080/15481603.2022.2116102","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"chinese academy of sciences","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Chinese Academy of Sciences","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"cn","key":"university of chinese academy of sciences","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"University of Chinese Academy of Sciences","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"cn","key":"cas nanjing institute of geography and limnology","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"CAS - Nanjing Institute of Geography and Limnology","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"us","key":"pennsylvania state university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Pennsylvania State University","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"cn","key":"zhejiang gongshang university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Zhejiang Gongshang University","used":1},{"affno":"7","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Arctic Research Centre, Arctic Research Centre - Arctic Research Center, ECOS Water","Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Ecoscience, Department of Ecoscience - Lake Ecology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Yibo","key":"zhangyibopau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Yibo","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3 4","corresponding":null,"first":"Kun","key":"shikunpau","last":"Shi","name":"Shi, Kun","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Xiao","key":"sunxiaopau","last":"Sun","name":"Sun, Xiao","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","corresponding":null,"first":"Yunlin","key":"zhangyunlinpau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Yunlin","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Na","key":"linapau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Na","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Weijia","key":"wangweijiapau","last":"Wang","name":"Wang, Weijia","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Yongqiang","key":"zhouyongqiangpau","last":"Zh