tral","status":"p","title":"Genome Biology","volume":"23"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85144774123"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-e7bba477-7adc-4e31-9042-ab6d9ff0d9a2","sdu-a82d0232-3b4d-4e7e-82db-1ed5ae20d9e7"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Implicating genes, pleiotropy, and sexual dimorphism at blood lipid loci through multi-ancestry meta-analysis","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-047005","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"As a distributed, fault-tolerant data warehouse system for large-scale data analytics, Apache Hive has been used for various applications in many organizations (e.g., Facebook, Amazon, and Huawei). Exploiting the large degrees of parallelism of GPU to improve the performance of online analytical processing (OLAP) in database system is a common practice in the industry. Meanwhile, it is a common practice to exploit the large degrees of parallelism of GPU to improve the performance of online analytical processing (OLAP) in database systems. This demo presents GHive, which enables Apache Hive to accelerate OLAP queries by jointly utilizing CPU and GPU in intelligent and efficient ways. The takeaways for SIGMOD attendees include: (1) the superior performance of GHive compared with vanilla Hive that only uses CPU; (2) intuitive visualizations of execution statistics for Hive and GHive to understand where the acceleration of GHive comes from; (3) detailed profiling of the time taken by each operator on CPU and GPU to show the advantages of GPU execution.","author_count":19,"contributors":["Liu, Haotian","Tang, Bo","Zhang, Jiashu","Deng, Yangshen","Zheng, Xinying","Shen, Qiaomu","Yan, Xiao","Zeng, Dan","Mao, Zunyao","Zhang, Chaozu","You, Zhengxin","Wang, Zhihao","Jiang, Runzhe","Wang, Fang","Yiu, Man Lung","Li, Huan","Han, Mingji","Li, Qian","Luo, Zhenghai"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-050851"],"event":{"end":"2022-06-17","place":"Virtual, Online, us","start":"2022-06-12","title":"2022 ACM SIGMOD International Conference on the Management of Data, SIGMOD 2022","year":"2022"},"filters":{"added":"2022-11","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Asia, East","OECD"],"country":["China","Hong Kong","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Hong Kong Polytechnic University","Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd.","Southern University of Science and Technology","University of Massachusetts"],"keyword":["O