"affno":"","first":"Joel N.","key":"hirschhornjoelnpau","last":"Hirschhorn","name":"Hirschhorn, Joel N.","rank":514,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Sekar","key":"kathiresansekarpau","last":"Kathiresan","name":"Kathiresan, Sekar","rank":515,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Michael","key":"boehnkemichaelpau","last":"Boehnke","name":"Boehnke, Michael","rank":516,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Pradeep","key":"natarajanpradeeppau","last":"Natarajan","name":"Natarajan, Pradeep","rank":517,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Gina M.","key":"pelosoginampau","last":"Peloso","name":"Peloso, Gina M.","rank":518,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Christopher D.","key":"brownchristopherdpau","last":"Brown","name":"Brown, Christopher D.","rank":519,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Andrew P.","key":"morrisandrewppau","last":"Morris","name":"Morris, Andrew P.","rank":520,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Themistocles L.","key":"assimesthemistocleslpau","last":"Assimes","name":"Assimes, Themistocles L.","rank":521,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Panos","key":"deloukaspanospau","last":"Deloukas","name":"Deloukas, Panos","rank":522,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Yan V.","key":"sunyanvpau","last":"Sun","name":"Sun, Yan V.","rank":523,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["34887591"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1038/s41586-021-04064-3","issn":["00280836","14764687"],"issn_org":["00280836"],"issue":"7890","journal":"Nature","pages":"675-679","publisher":"Nature Research","status":"p","title":"Nature","volume":"600"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85121605114"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-82197af4-0844-4350-80c2-a858a2138491","sdu-a20f86a2-5b61-4a06-a7a5-9bdecb434faa"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"The power of genetic diversity in genome-wide association studies of lipids","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-086.00-043943","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"The non-fully conjugated polymer as a new class of acceptor materials has shown some advantages over its small molecular counterpart when used in photoactive layers for all-polymer solar cells (all-PSCs), despite a low power conversion efficiency (PCE) caused by its narrow absorption spectra. Herein, a novel non-fully conjugated polymer acceptor PFY-2TS with a low bandgap of ~1.40 eV was developed, via polymerizing a large π-fused small molecule acceptor (SMA) building block (namely YBO) with a non-conjugated thioalkyl linkage. Compared with its precursor YBO, PFY-2TS retains a similar low bandgap but a higher LUMO level. Moreover, compared with the structural analog of YBO-based fully conjugated polymer acceptor PFY-DTC, PFY-2TS shows a similar absorption spectrum and electron mobility, but significantly different molecular crystallinity and aggregation properties, which results in optimal blend morphology with a polymer donor PBDB-T and physical processes of the device in all-PSCs. As a result, PFY-2TS-based all-PSCs achieved a PCE of 12.31% with a small energy loss of 0.56 eV enabled by the reduced non-radiative energy loss (0.24 eV), which is better than that of 11.08% for the PFY-DTC-based ones. Our work clearly demonstrated that non-fully conjugated polymers as a new class of acceptor materials are very promising for the development of high-performance all-PSCs. [Figure not available: see fulltext.].","author_count":20,"contributors":["Fan, Qunping","Ma, Ruijie","Liu, Tao","Yu, Jianwei","Xiao, Yiqun","Su, Wenyan","Cai, Guilong","Li, Yuxiang","Peng, Wenhong","Guo, Tao","Luo, Zhenghui","Sun, Huiliang","Hou, Lintao","Zhu, Weiguo","Lu, Xinhui","Gao, Feng","Moons, Ellen","Yu, Donghong","Yan, He","Wang, Ergang"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-055037"],"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Wang, Ergang"],"country":["China","Hong Kong","Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Chalmers University of Technology","Changzhou University","Chinese University of Hong Kong","Hong Kong University of Science and Technology","Jinan University","Karlstad University","Linköping University","Sino-Danish Center for Education and Research","Xi'an University of Science and Technology","Zhengzhou University"],"keyword":["All polymer solar cells","Energy loss","Morphology","Power conversion efficiency"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"high performance all polymer solar cells enabled by a novel low bandgap non fully conjugated polymer acceptor","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85112386404&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["This work was supported by the Swedish Research Council (2015-04853, 2016-06146, 2019-04683), the Swedish Research Council Formas, the Knut and Alice Wallenberg Foundation (2017.0186, 2016.0059), and the Open Fund of the State Key Laboratory of Luminescent Materials and Devices (South China University of Technology, 2020-skllmd-07). E. Moons thanks the Swedish Energy Council for financial support (project 48598-1). W. Su thanks the project funded by China Postdoctoral Science Foundation (2020M673054), Postdoctoral Fund of Jinan University, and the National Natural Science Foundation of China (22005121). L. Hou thanks the National Natural Science Foundation of China (61774077). Support from Sino-Danish Centre for Education and Research is fully acknowledged by D. Yu. Y. Li thanks the financial support from the Science and Technology Program of Shanxi Province (2019JQ-244)."],"id":"S01-000.00-055037","identifier":[{"id":"85112386404","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-11140217-2ec4-4c4e-9e5f-9ed1179d53ea"],"keyword":["all-polymer solar cells","energy loss","morphology","non-fully conjugated polymer acceptors","power conversion efficiency"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-4EBEF9FACCEF149245EB0DA51BE3099E"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"se","key":"chalmers university of technology","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Chalmers University of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"hk","key":"hong kong university of science and technology","loc":["Hong Kong","Asia, East"],"name":"Hong Kong University of Science and Technology","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"se","key":"linköping university","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Linköping University","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"hk","key":"chinese university of hong kong","loc":["Hong Kong","Asia, East"],"name":"Chinese University of Hong Kong","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"se","key":"karlstad university","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Karlstad University","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"cn","key":"jinan university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Jinan University","used":1},{"affno":"7","country":"cn","key":"xi an university of science and technology","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Xi'an University of Science and Technology","used":1},{"affno":"8","country":"cn","key":"changzhou university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Changzhou University","used":1},{"affno":"9","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty o