{"abstract":"C/C–SiC composites are considered to be strong candidates for the new generation of high-speed train brake discs. To achieve a better application, it is necessary to improve understanding of the oxidation behaviour of C/C–SiC brake discs after a full-scale bench test rig. In this study, full-scale braking bench tests for C/C–SiC self-mated brake pairs were conducted under a braking speed of 350–420 km/h and a braking pressure of 17–28 kN. Moreover, the oxidation behaviour and mechanisms of the C/C–SiC brake discs during the practical braking process were investigated. The results indicate that the oxidation behaviour is highly dependent on the friction surface region of the C/C–SiC brake disc owing to the distribution of microcracks, the formation of friction films, the difference in temperature, and the contact content with O2. Specifically, the oxidation depths of the friction layer on the inner circumferential surface, middle friction surface, and outer circumferential surface were 278.3, 252.1, and 359.9 μm, respectively. Furthermore, the oxidation reaction preferentially occurs in the active area of the C fibre and pyrolytic carbon (PyC) during the braking process.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Deng, Pingyi","Li, Pengtao","Xiao, Peng","Li, Zhuan","Li, Jinwei","Chen, Pengju","Liu, Pengfei","Li, Feng"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-073046"],"filters":{"added":"2022-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"corresponding_author":["Xiao, Peng"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Central South University"],"keyword":["Behaviour","Microstructure","Oxidation"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"oxidation behaviour of c c sic brake discs tested on full scale bench rig","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85114288215&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["This work was supported by the National Natural Science Foundation of China (Grant No. 52075555 ), the Natural Science Foundation of Hunan Province of China (Grant No. 2019JJ50768 ), the Special Funds for the Construction of Innovative Provinces of Hunan Province (Grant No. 2020GK2063 ), and the Graduate Research Innovation Project of Central South University ( 2020zzts457 )."],"id":"S01-000.00-073046","identifier":[{"id":"85114288215","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-4f5ac90a-44e3-4b50-a413-63248cc840d4"],"keyword":["Behaviour","C/C–SiC brake Disc","Full-scale bench test rig","Microstructure","Oxidation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-1EF2D3B1B0B4B396B593957BC17113E2"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"central south university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Central South University","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience, Disordered Materials","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience, Section of Chemistry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Pingyi","key":"dengpingyipau","last":"Deng","name":"Deng, Pingyi","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Pengtao","key":"lipengtaopau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Pengtao","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Peng","key":"xiaopengpau","last":"Xiao","name":"Xiao, Peng","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Zhuan","key":"lizhuanpau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Zhuan","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jinwei","key":"lijinweipau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Jinwei","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Pengju","key":"chenpengjupau","last":"Chen","name":"Chen, Pengju","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Pengfei","key":"liupengfeipau","last":"Liu","locid":"670a1205-2565-4aaf-9a34-a0471fd58659","name":"Liu, Pengfei","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Feng","key":"lifengpau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Feng","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.ceramint.2021.09.017","issn":["02728842","18733956"],"issn_org":["02728842"],"issue":"24","journal":"Ceramics International","pages":"34783-34793","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Ceramics International","volume":"47"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85114288215"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-4f5ac90a-44e3-4b50-a413-63248cc840d4"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Oxidation behaviour of C/C–SiC brake discs tested on full-scale bench rig","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-073046","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Hydrate process is considered as a promising method for carbon dioxide (CO2) capture, separation, storage, and sequestration in the field of land-based CO2 removal and marine-based CO2 storage. In this work, the process of CO2 dissolution and hydrate formation were thoroughly investigated in the stirring and statics systems, containing the integrated gasification combined cycle (IGCC) gas mixture, cyclopentane (CP) and tetrahydrofuran (THF) aqueous solution. The experiment results show that the stable mass transfer resistance can be supplied by adding 10 vol% CP. The method of stirring can update the liquid CP-aqueous solution interface effectively and have no effect on the hydrate structures.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Cai, Jing","Zhao, Qi","Xu, Chun-Gang","Li, Xiao-Sen","von Solms, Nicolas","Liang, Xiaodong"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-311648"],"event":{"end":"2021-12-02","place":"Bangkok, th","start":"2021-11-29","title":"International Conference on Applied Energy 2021","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"corresponding_author":["Li, Xiao-Sen"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Chinese Academy of Sciences","University of Science and Technology of China"],"keyword":["CO2 hydrate","Cyclopentane","Microscopic analysis","Tetrahydrofuran"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"microscopic insights on co sub 000000000002 sub dissolution and hydrate formation by using i in situ i analysis in the system of igcc thf and cp","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-311648","ids":["dtu-1780358c-166b-4b6e-998b-d50d69ed0040"],"keyword":["CO2 hydrate","Cyclopentane","IGCC","Microscopic analysis","Tetrahydrofuran"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-621F63315DE44368C45C4A367AD980F2"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Centers, Center for Energy Resources Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemical and Biochemical Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemical and Biochemical Engineering, CERE – Center for Energy Ressources Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"cn","key":"university of science and technology of china","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"University of Science and Technology of China","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"cn","key":"chinese academy of sciences","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Chinese Academy of Sciences","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jing","key":"caipau","last":"Cai","locid":"ee1d71c8-c0ea-4e29-9b1b-690fd743e694","name":"Cai, Jing","orcid":"0000-0002-6311-0210","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Qi","key":"zhaopau","last":"Zhao","name":"Zhao, Qi","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Chun-Gang","key":"xupau","last":"Xu","name":"Xu, Chun-Gang","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Xiao-Sen","key":"lipau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Xiao-Sen","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Nicolas","key":"vonsolmspau","last":"von Solms","locid":"8ae12603-c1ee-4bf7-8893-337b5b940cfb","name":"von Solms, Nicolas","orcid":"0000-0002-5007-8987","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Xiaodong","key":"liangpau","last":"Liang","locid":"723584e2-cb7e-488c-a430-f85e705739b3","name":"Liang, Xiaodong","orcid":"0000-0002-2007-546X","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","sdg":["14. Life Below Water","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-1780358c-166b-4b6e-998b-d50d69ed0040"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Microscopic insights on CO<sub>2</sub> dissolution and hydrate formation by using<i> in-situ </i>analysis in the system of IGCC, THF and CP","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-311648","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Structural mapping of intermediate size and large molecules and biomolecules at ultra-high resolution using single-crystal electrodes and in situ scanning tunnelling microscopy continues to disclose surprising findings. In situ scanning tunnelling spectroscopy has also recently disclosed new electrochemical conductivity features at the level of the single molecule. We overview briefly elements of this development over the last few years, with focus on three recent discoveries: (1) a new packing mode of a core monolayer target thiol, the amino acid cysteine (Cys) on Au(100)-electrodes, quite different from Cys packing on Au(111)- and Au(110)-electrodes; (2) transition of a core ferrocene in situ scanning tunnelling spectroscopy probe from stochastic single-molecule to macroscopic behaviour, a concept at the heart of nanoscience; and (3) unexpected behaviour of the large molybdenum enzyme sulfite oxidase, when going from macroscopic to single-molecule electrochemistry. We compare these studies with other recent discoveries of single-molecule protein conductivity and molecular scale inorganic nanostructures.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Engelbrekt, Christian","Glukhov, Dmitrii","Li, Yueqi","Nazmutdinov, Renat R.","Tang, Jing","Ulstrup, Jens","Wang, Zixiao","Xiao, Xinxin","Yan, Jiawei","Yan, Xiaomei","Zinkicheva, Tamara"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-318213"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East","Europe, Non-EU"],"corresponding_author":["Ulstrup, Jens"],"country":["China","Russia"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Kazan National Research Technological University","Nanjing University"],"keyword":["Scanning tunnelling spectroscopy","Sulfite oxidase"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"electrochemistry of complex molecular and biomolecular scale entities","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"djr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/238952713/Post_printed_version.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["Financial support from The Danish Council for Independent Research for the YDUN project ( DFF 4093-00297 ) and Villum Experiment (grant No. 35844 ) is gratefully acknowledged. X.Y. acknowledges support from the China Scholarship Council (No. 201806650009 ). The Russian Foundation of Basic Research (project № 20-03-007724 ) to R.R.N., T.T.Z. and J.U."],"id":"S01-000.00-318213","identifier":[{"id":"85099177671","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-2de3d11f-97e1-4ec8-a941-46a506ca6006"],"keyword":["Cysteine on Au(100)","Scanning tunnelling spectroscopy","Single-entity electrochemistry","Stochastic conductivity of redox molecules","Sulfite oxidase"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-6866D5763D65D2945EA0EDD32DA8A425"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/238952713/Post_printed_version.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemistry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"ru","key":"kazan national research technological university","loc":["Russia","Europe, Non-EU"],"name":"Kazan National Research Technological University","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"cn","key":"nanjing university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Nanjing University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Christian","key":"engelbrektchristianpau","last":"Engelbrekt","locid":"a1b586e6-3d4b-4ebc-9037-259adc94bc5a","name":"Engelbrekt, Christian","orcid":"0000-0003-3679-3666","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Dmitrii","key":"glukhovdmitriipau","last":"Glukhov","name":"Glukhov, Dmitrii","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Yueqi","key":"liyueqipau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Yueqi","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Renat R.","key":"nazmutdinovrenatrpau","last":"Nazmutdinov","name":"Nazmutdinov, Renat R.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jing","key":"tangjingpau","last":"Tang","locid":"17f36bc9-1402-45d6-9b97-0e7fbc050297","name":"Tang, Jing","orcid":"0000-0002-8745-9177","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens","key":"ulstrupjenspau","last":"Ulstrup","locid":"a7bf8f77-fd81-4dce-8592-8c7bec26750b","name":"Ulstrup, Jens","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Zixiao","key":"wangzixiaopau","last":"Wang","name":"Wang, Zixiao","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Xinxin","key":"xiaoxinxinpau","last":"Xiao","locid":"8cd768ff-d2df-4d64-bd7c-0d46854d561c","name":"Xiao, Xinxin","orcid":"0000-0002-0240-0038","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jiawei","key":"yanjiaweipau","last":"Yan","name":"Yan, Jiawei","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Xiaomei","key":"yanxiaomeipau","last":"Yan","locid":"a00e6ff6-cd93-4cf4-be11-0fb95211c220","name":"Yan, Xiaomei","orcid":"0000-0003-1882-4713","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Tamara","key":"zinkichevatamarapau","last":"Zinkicheva","name":"Zinkicheva, Tamara","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.coelec.2020.100670","issn":["24519103","24519111"],"issn_org":["24519103"],"journal":"Current Opinion in Electrochemistry","paperid":"100670","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Current Opinion in Electrochemistry","volume":"26"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85099177671"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-2de3d11f-97e1-4ec8-a941-46a506ca6006"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Electrochemistry of complex molecular and biomolecular scale entities","type":"Journal Review","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-318213","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"New energy development and carbon emission reduction are two important issues of sustainable development for human beings. Hydrate-based methane - carbon dioxide (CH4-CO2) replacement is the promising technology for it can realize CH4 production from natural gas hydrate (NGH) and CO2 capture and sequestration (CCS) in the strata simultaneously and stably. This work reported the micro mechanism and the influence of the hydrate-based CH4-CO2 replacement by differential scanning calorimetry (DSC) measurements and in situ Raman spectroscopy measurements. It was found the replacement is affected by the potential energy of destruction (Eped) and the binding energy (Eb). The replacement happens only when the Eped is larger than the Eb. The concentration of CO2 around the hydrate is the controlling influence on the replacement. The higher the concentration of CO2, the greater the Eped, and the higher CH4 production efficiency.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Xu, Chun-Gang","Zhang, Wei","Yan, Ke-Feng","Cai, Jing","Chen, Zhao-Yang","Li, Xiao-Sen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-354930"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"corresponding_author":["Li, Xiao-Sen"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Chinese Academy of Sciences"],"keyword":["CCS","Methane recovery","Natural gas hydrate"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"research on micro mechanism and influence of hydrate based methane carbon dioxide replacement for realizing simultaneous clean energy exploitation and carbon emission reduction","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/271074302/Manuscript_20210511.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-354930","identifier":[{"id":"85119332672","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-a8b2723b-45ff-46cd-8370-dea728a96311"],"keyword":["CCS","CH4-CO2 replacement","Methane recovery","Microcosmic mechanism","Natural gas hydrate"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-BA4BC8ED7E5AC9EE41CE37C997678EFC"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/271074302/Manuscript_20210511.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"chinese academy of sciences","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Chinese Academy of Sciences","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemical and Biochemical Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemical and Biochemical Engineering, CERE – Center for Energy Ressources Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Chun-Gang","key":"xupau","last":"Xu","name":"Xu, Chun-Gang","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Wei","key":"zhangpau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Wei","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ke-Feng","key":"yanpau","last":"Yan","name":"Yan, Ke-Feng","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jing","key":"caipau","last":"Cai","locid":"ee1d71c8-c0ea-4e29-9b1b-690fd743e694","name":"Cai, Jing","orcid":"0000-0002-6311-0210","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Zhao-Yang","key":"chenpau","last":"Chen","name":"Chen, Zhao-Yang","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Xiao-Sen","key":"lipau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Xiao-Sen","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.ces.2021.117266","issn":["00092509","18734405"],"issn_org":["00092509"],"journal":"Chemical Engineering Science","paperid":"117266","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Chemical Engineering Science","volume":"248"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85119332672"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-a8b2723b-45ff-46cd-8370-dea728a96311"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Research on micro mechanism and influence of hydrate-based methane-carbon dioxide replacement for realizing simultaneous clean energy exploitation and carbon emission reduction","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-354930","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"The emergence of the novel human coronavirus, SARS-CoV-2, causes a global COVID-19 (coronavirus disease 2019) pandemic. Here, we have characterized and compared viral populations of SARS-CoV-2 among COVID-19 patients within and across households. Our work showed an active viral replication activity in the human respiratory tract and the co-existence of genetically distinct viruses within the same host. The inter-host comparison among viral populations further revealed a narrow transmission bottleneck between patients from the same households, suggesting a dominated role of stochastic dynamics in both inter-host and intra-host evolutions.","author_count":32,"contributors":["Wang, Daxi","Wang, Yanqun","Sun, Wanying","Zhang, Lu","Ji, Jingkai","Zhang, Zhaoyong","Cheng, Xinyi","Li, Yimin","Xiao, Fei","Zhu, Airu","Zhong, Bei","Ruan, Shicong","Li, Jiandong","Ren, Peidi","Ou, Zhihua","Xiao, Minfeng","Li, Min","Deng, Ziqing","Zhong, Huanzi","Li, Fuqiang","Wang, Wen-jing","Zhang, Yongwei","Chen, Weijun","Zhu, Shida","Xu, Xun","Jin, Xin","Zhao, Jingxian","Zhong, Nanshan","Zhang, Wenwei","Zhao, Jincun","Li, Junhua","Xu, Yonghao"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-462731"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","BGI"],"keyword":["Evolution","Intra host variation","SARS CoV 2","population bottleneck"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"population bottlenecks and intra host evolution during human to human transmission of sars cov 000000000002","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3389/fmed.2021.585358","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-462731","identifier":[{"id":"85101935416","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC7917136","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"33659260","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-73e185d3-49c7-41a5-8525-fd8ff3210dc9"],"keyword":["SARS-CoV-2","evolution","human to human transmission","intra-host variation","population bottleneck"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-215224E2597B0D183145E8D2C25B24FF"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3389/fmed.2021.585358","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/258493960/Population_Bottlenecks_and_Intra_host_Evolution_During_Human_to_Human_Transmission_of_SARS_CoV_2.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"bgi","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"BGI","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Biology, Genome Research and Molecular Bio Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Daxi","key":"wangdaxipau","last":"Wang","name":"Wang, Daxi","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Yanqun","key":"wangyanqunpau","last":"Wang","name":"Wang, Yanqun","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Wanying","key":"sunwanyingpau","last":"Sun","name":"Sun, Wanying","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Lu","key":"zhanglupau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Lu","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jingkai","key":"jijingkaipau","last":"Ji","name":"Ji, Jingkai","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Zhaoyong","key":"zhan