{"abstract":"The wide utilization of power electronic converters causes the constant power load stability issue in DC microgrids. This paper proposes an offset-free model predictive controller for a DC/DC boost converter feeding constant power loads. First, a baseline nonlinear model predictive controller is designed by solving a receding horizon optimization problem explicitly. Then a higher-order sliding mode observer is utilized to estimate the unknown load variation and system uncertainties. Finally an offset-free controller is integrated by the baseline controller and observer. The proposed controller achieves optimized transient dynamics and accurate tracking with large signal stability. Simulation results are presented to verify the proposed approach.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Xu, Qianwen","Blaabjerg, Frede","Zhang, Chuanlin","Yang, Jun","Li, Shihua","Xiao, Jianfang"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-114010"],"event":{"acronym":"IES","end":"2019-10-17","place":"Lisbon, pt","start":"2019-10-14","title":"IECON 2019 - 45th Annual Conference of the IEEE Industrial Electronics Society","year":"2019"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["China","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Newcastle University","Shanghai University of Electric Power","Southeast University, Nanjing"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"an offset free model predictive controller for dc dc boost converter feeding constant power loads in dc microgrids","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-114010","identifier":[{"id":"85084051480","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-dc104e62-f270-4538-bd8b-57f925a6f0c5"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-F70C1F5EA0D808167819051C8E0F9639"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Power Electronic Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"cn","key":"shanghai university of electric power","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Shanghai University of Electric Power","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"cn","key":"southeast university nanjing","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Southeast University, Nanjing","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"gb","key":"newcastle university","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Newcastle University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Qianwen","key":"xupau","last":"Xu","locid":"4426b16d-1573-430b-9f2b-ab5fa1754d85","name":"Xu, Qianwen","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Frede","key":"blaabjergpau","last":"Blaabjerg","locid":"22b09e36-1f7b-4d33-90bf-918730e1d09a","name":"Blaabjerg, Frede","orcid":"0000-0001-8311-7412","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Chuanlin","key":"zhangpau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Chuanlin","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Jun","key":"yangpau","last":"Yang","name":"Yang, Jun","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Shihua","key":"lipau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Shihua","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Jianfang","key":"xiaopau","last":"Xiao","name":"Xiao, Jianfang","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/iecon.2019.8927783","eisbn":["9781728148786"],"isbn":["9781728148793"],"issn":["1553572X"],"pages":"4045-4049","place":"Portugal","publisher":"IEEE Press","series":"Proceedings of the Annual Conference of the IEEE Industrial Electronics Society","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of IECON 2019 - 45th Annual Conference of the IEEE Industrial Electronics Society"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85084051480"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-dc104e62-f270-4538-bd8b-57f925a6f0c5"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"An Offset-free Model Predictive Controller for DC/DC Boost Converter Feeding Constant Power Loads in DC Microgrids","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-114010","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Aims: A pilot survey shows that primary nocturnal enuresis (PNE) prevalence has increased significantly during the past decade in Mainland China. Whether it is related to the delay of elimination communication (EC) is unclear. This study retrospectively investigated the influence of delayed EC on the PNE prevalence in children and adolescents in mainland China. Methods: A cross-sectional study of PNE prevalence was performed by distributing 19 500 anonymous self-administered questionnaires to parents in five provinces of mainland China from July 2017 to October 2017. The questionnaires included sociodemographic data, family caregivers’ information, and details about the disposable diapers (DD) usage, EC commencement date, psychological disorders, lower urinary tract symptoms, and family history of PNE in children and adolescents. The 2017 PNE prevalence was compared with that of 2006 in Mainland China. Results: The total response rate was 97.04% (18 631 of 19 500) and 92.39% (18 016 of 19 500) qualified for statistical analysis. The PNE prevalence in 2017 has increased significantly compared to that of 2006 (7.30% vs 4.07%, P < 0.001). The PNE prevalence in children with EC starting before 6 months of age was significantly lower than those who start after 12 months of age. The longer DD were used and the later the beginning of EC, the higher the PNE prevalence was found. Conclusions: The PNE prevalence in Mainland China has increased significantly during the past 10 years. A longer use of DD and later onset of EC may be risk factors for PNE.","author_count":20,"contributors":["Wang, Xi Zheng","Wen, Yi Bo","Shang, Xiao Ping","Wang, Yi He","Li, Yan Wei","Li, Tian Fang","Li, Shou Lin","Yang, Jing","Liu, Yan Jin","Lou, Xiao Ping","Zhou, Wei","Li, Xing","Zhang, Jian Jiang","Song, Cui Ping","Jørgensen, Cecilie Siggaard","Rittig, Søren","Bauer, Stuart","Mosiello, Giovanni","Wang, Qing Wei","Wen, Jian Guo"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-151622"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Asia, East","Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Wang, Qing Wei"],"country":["China","Italy","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Bambino Gesù (baby Jesus) Children's Hospital – IRCCS","Boston Children's Hospital","Shenzhen Children's Hospital","The First Affiliated Hospital of Zhengzhou University"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the influence of delay elimination communication on the prevalence of primary nocturnal enuresis a survey from mainland china","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85067401891","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-151622","identifier":[{"id":"30998267","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85067401891","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-26d353d2-7be1-4be9-89ba-c3cd8bb812be"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-7933416BA063C7CB12ED088B036B287A"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"the first affiliated hospital of zhengzhou university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"The First Affiliated Hospital of Zhengzhou University","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"cn","key":"shenzhen children s hospital","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Shenzhen Children's Hospital","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},