,"DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-217f7d21-00d9-4e97-941b-6f726e96c9f6"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"A multi-ancestry genome-wide study incorporating gene-smoking interactions identifies multiple new loci for pulse pressure and mean arterial pressure","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-413458","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"In river network areas,the control of agricultural non-point source pollution (ANPSP)should consider not only the pollutant removal effect and cost but also the resource utilization efficiency. Taking Xinjian Town,Yixing City on the west bank of Taihu Lake as an example,the volume of wastewater and the pollutant loads discharged from three pollution sources (crop farming,livestock and aquaculture)were investigated. The demand of water for irrigation and the potential reuse of wastewater for irrigation and the potential reuse of nitrogen (N)and phosphorus (P)from manure and wastewater for fertilizing cropland were also estimated. The performance of two schemes of ANPSP control system (Scheme I:reuse of all livestock wastewater and manure;Scheme?:reuse of all livestock wastewater and manure and some aquaculture wastewater)on pollutant reduction efficiency (TN,TP,NH3-N,and COD)and economic cost were evaluated. The results show that if all the livestock wastewater (71.96×103 m3) and some aquaculture wastewater (2 277.11×103 m3)were reused for irrigation after processing could meet the total irrigation water demand in Xinjian Town (Scheme II). The removal efficiencies of Scheme II for the pollutants TN,TP,NH3-N,and COD were 84.3%, 94.2%,89.6% and 94.0%,respectively. In addition,Scheme II could reduce the use of chemical fertilizers by nearly 81.8 kg·hm-2 of N and 39.9 kg·hm-2 of P annually. In order to reduce costs,Scheme I that only reuse livestock wastewater (71.96×103 m3)for irrigation after processing could only meet with 3% of irrigation water demand. The removal efficiencies of Scheme I for the pollutants TN,TP,NH3-N,and COD were 83.0%,93.7%,88.7% and 93.7%,respectively,and the use of N and P fertilizers can be reduced by nearly 52.0 and 34.2 kg·hm-2 annually. The proposed two schemes of ANPSP control system with consideration of nutrients and wastewater recycling may provide a reference for the construction of pollution control projects in Xinjian Town.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Sun, Xiao Lei","Hu, Zheng Yi","Li, Liu","Li, Song Yan","Liu, Fulai"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-461224"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Sino-Danish Center for education and research","University of Chinese Academy of Sciences"],"keyword":["Taihu lake"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"基于肥水资源化的河网区镇域农业面源污染控制系统的构建 以太湖地区新建镇为例","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-461224","identifier":[{"id":"85073695013","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-7179bbc1-30fb-4033-ac80-57a734c988bb"],"keyword":["Agricultural non-point-source pollution","Reuse of wastewater and nutrient","Systems for controlling pollution in town","Taihu lake"],"lang":"Chinese","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-E7BD4E4BE8CCF3C02BCAB1D999A5BD83"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Plant and Environmental Sciences, Section for Crop Sciences"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"cn","key":"university of chinese academy of sciences","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"University of Chinese Academy of Sciences","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"cn","key":"sino danish center for education and research","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Sino-Danish Center for education and research","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Xiao Lei","key":"sunxiaoleipau","last":"Sun","locid":"568e512e-5075-46b7-862a-e5a8aab7213f","name":"Sun, Xiao Lei","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","first":"Zheng Yi","key":"huzhengyipau","last":"Hu","name":"Hu, Zheng Yi","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Liu","key":"liliupau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Liu","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Song Yan","key":"lisongyanpau","last":"Li","locid":"f5531618-f952-41a2-b5a2-4e5b06271a40","name":"Li, Song Yan","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Fu Lai","key":"liufulaipau","last":"Liu","locid":"dc299ce8-5a4c-46f4-9af0-4d935f7cf190","name":"Liu, Fulai","name_org":"Liu, Fu Lai","orcid":"0000-0002-5006-8965","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.19741/j.issn.1673-4831.2018.0478","issn":["16734831"],"issue":"5","journal":"Journal of Ecology and Rural Environment","pages":"582-592","status":"p","title":"Journal of Ecology and Rural Environment","volume":"35"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85073695013"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-7179bbc1-30fb-4033-ac80-57a734c988bb"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"基于肥水资源化的河网区镇域农业面源污染控制系统的构建 : 以太湖地区新建镇为例","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-461224","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
