{"abstract":"As a developmental psychologist who has conducted studies in educational practice for about thirty years. A series of developmental psychology studies rooted in Chinese culture were performed, and the findings led us to focus on students’ potential in growth, developmental fullness and educational ecosystem. This article mainly talked about three aspects: the viewpoints about the nature of psychological development formed in the context of school; promoting students’ development by continually constructing cultural ecosystem; the characteristics of researches by taking the perspective of cultural ecology and discoveries about deficiency in basic abilities. All of these were based on educational objectives and conducted in educational practice, so they were integrative and dynamic transformation. In educational intervention, aesthetic potential was also found. The relation between aesthetic potential and full development was put forward.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Li, Xiao Wen","Xu, Shuangshuang"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-075067"],"filters":{"added":"2022-07","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"corresponding_author":["Li, Xiao Wen"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","East China Normal University","School of Psychology and Cognitive Science"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"developmental psychology research based on educational practice in china","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85047933518&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["Funding Most of the researches in this study were funded by the major projects of humanities and social sciences of China’s ministry, (05JJD880008 and 09JJDXLX003)."],"id":"S01-000.00-075067","identifier":[{"id":"29855785","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85047933518","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-563068ab-80ee-4cda-aab5-033b652e0fd6"],"keyword":["Cultural ecological perspective","Scaffolding to potential development","Viewpoint of development"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-F1138427F503684B411B2213D2970A5F"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"east china normal university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"East China Normal University","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Qualitative Studies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"cn","key":"school of psychology and cognitive science","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"School of Psychology and Cognitive Science","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Xiao Wen","key":"lipau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Xiao Wen","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2 3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Shuang Shuang","key":"xupau","last":"Xu","locid":"95299298-09f9-45b0-8cf4-a0d5f114760d","name":"Xu, Shuangshuang","name_org":"Xu, Shuang Shuang","orcid":"0000-0002-3830-542X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["29855785"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/s12124-018-9438-6","issn":["19324502","19363567"],"issn_org":["19324502"],"issue":"3","journal":"Integrative Psychological & Behavioral Science","pages":"341-350","publisher":"Springer Publishing Company","status":"p","title":"Integrative Psychological & Behavioral Science","title_org":"Integrative Psychological and Behavioral Science","volume":"52"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-563068ab-80ee-4cda-aab5-033b652e0fd6"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Developmental Psychology Research Based on Educational Practice in China","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-075067","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Considering that the impact of fast frequent start and stop of the shipboard electric bow thruster on the fuel efficiency and system stability in the shipboard microgrid, this paper proposes to add the battery storage in the DC bus of the bow thruster diver and supply for the driver of the bow thruster. The scheme can effectively reduce the capacity of diesel generators, improve fuel consumption efficiency, and reduce the disturbance of the voltage and frequency of the shipboard power system. At the same time, because the bow thruster can operate as a generator when braking, the battery storage can replace the consumption resistance and absorb the energy generated by the fast braking machine. An adaptive PI controller for the voltage loop is designed for three phase interleaved DC-DC converter to increase the load capacity of the converter. And this paper analyzes the selection range of controller parameters. Simulation results show that the controller can effectively suppress the voltage swell and sag of DC bus during the frequent start-up process of the bow thruster.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Xiao, Zhaoxia","Li, Huaimin","Zhu, Tianli","Guerrero, Josep M.","Feng, Ji"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-088110"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"corresponding_author":["Xiao, Zhaoxia"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","State Grid Tianjin Cable Company","Tiangong University"],"keyword":["Battery storage","Bow thruster","Microgrids","Shipboard microgrid","feedback Generation"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"提高船舶微电网艏侧推进器运行能效的控制策略","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/301694615/10.11_.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-088110","identifier":[{"id":"85062921909","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-82c51605-8d60-4261-863a-9edcb7535fc3"],"keyword":["Adaptive PI controller","Battery storage","Bow thruster","Feedback generation","Shipboard microgrid","Three-phase interleaved parallel DC-DC converter","microgrids"],"lang":"Chinese","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-831E14EB98996E209874310BAD0F9DF4"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/301694615/10.11_.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"tiangong university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Tiangong University","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Power Electronic Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"cn","key":"state grid tianjin cable company","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"State Grid Tianjin Cable Company","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Zhaoxia","key":"xiaopau","last":"Xiao","name":"Xiao, Zhaoxia","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Huaimin","key":"lipau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Huaimin","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Tianli","key":"zhupau","last":"Zhu","name":"Zhu, Tianli","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Josep M.","key":"guerreropau","last":"Guerrero