osity in Chinese and Western pig breeds evaluated by reduced-representation sequencing data","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-023310","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"As an integration of energy technology and information communication technology, \"Energy Internet” is the new driving force for global development of clean and efficient energy systems. This paper summaries the concept and characteristics of “Energy Internet\" and the sustainable urban development; describes some concepts and achievements in the field, and expounds the driving forces for the development of Energy Internet. An example of multi energy system is presented to illustrate that the Energy Internet. The multi energy internet can effectively improve energy efficiency, protect the environment, promote the city’s circular economy, and have good economic and social benefits for sustainable urban development.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Jiang, Zhihong","Han, Jian","Liu, Wenzhou","Chen, Zhe","Li, Ning","Wang, Siyuan","Zhang, Xiao","Liu, Chang"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-089868"],"event":{"end":"2018-06-07","place":"Shanghai, cn","start":"2018-06-05","title":"CUE2018-Applied Energy Symposium and Forum 2018","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Changchun Institute of Technology","Changchun University of Technology","Tsinghua University"],"keyword":["Circular economy","Energy internet","Sustainable development"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"energy internet a new driving force for sustainable urban development","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.egypro.2018.09.170","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-089868","identifier":[{"id":"85058207558","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000470975400191","type":"wos"}],"ids":["aau-88dea673-c827-4e33-a085-b5cd4f9579c6"],"keyword":["Circular Economy","Energy Internet","Sustainable Development"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-6E5EB64FCBE4B10DCE1642CEDEE593E7"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.egypro.2018.09.170","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/305237817/1_s2.0_S1876610218307148_main.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"changchun university of technology","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Changchun University of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"cn","key":"changchun institute of technology","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Changchun Institute of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Electric Power Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"cn","key":"tsinghua university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Tsinghua University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Zhihong","key":"jiangzhihongpau","last":"Jiang","name":"Jiang, Zhihong","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jian","key":"hanjianpau","last":"Han","name":"Han, Jian","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Wenzhou","key":"liuwen