{"abstract":"This paper compares two types of three-phase transformerless unified power quality conditioner (UPQC) and analyzes their performance under different grid or load conditions. Unbalanced grid voltage or load current will cause the DC-side voltage imbalance with the traditional control strategy. Thus an improved control method is proposed to suppress the DC-side voltage imbalance, which is analyzed in detail. Finally, the correctness of the proposed method is verified by PLECS simulation.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Li, Fujian","Xiao, Guochun","Zhao, Fangzhou","Zhang, Shuai","Liu, Baojin"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-058607"],"event":{"end":"2018-05-24","place":"Niigata, jp","start":"2018-05-20","title":"8th International Power Electronics Conference, IPEC-Niigata - ECCE Asia 2018","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2022-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Xi'an Jiaotong University"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a control method for two types of three phase transformerless unified power quality conditioner","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85057321732&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-058607","identifier":[{"id":"85057321732","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-1d503214-2ed1-4056-990a-d27e187eb048"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-F5AC466FA3B0F7AD5D5E84C8779E4614"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"xi an jiaotong university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Xi'an Jiaotong University","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Electronic Power Grid","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Power Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Power Electronics System Integration and Materials"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Fujian","key":"lipau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Fujian","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Guochun","key":"xiaopau","last":"Xiao","name":"Xiao, Guochun","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Fangzhou","key":"zhaopau","last":"Zhao","locid":"2ddf0e0a-8a87-4d47-b713-b623cb6a2bc3","name":"Zhao, Fangzhou","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Shuai","key":"zhangpau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Shuai","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Baojin","key":"liupau","last":"Liu","name":"Liu, Baojin","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.23919/ipec.2018.8507625","eisbn":["9784886864055"],"pages":"2944-2947","publisher":"IEEE Signal Processing Society","series":"2018 International Power Electronics Conference, IPEC-Niigata - ECCE Asia","status":"p","title":"2018 International Power Electronics Conference, IPEC-Niigata - ECCE Asia 2018"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-1d503214-2ed1-4056-990a-d27e187eb048"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"A Control Method for Two Types of Three-Phase Transformerless Unified Power Quality Conditioner","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-058607","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"The inability to intraoperatively diagnose and eliminate microscopic residual tumors represents a significant challenge in cancer surgery. These residual microtumors cause lethal recurrence and metastasis. Herein, we show a crucial example of Raman imaging with gap-enhanced Raman tags (GERTs) to serve as a robust platform for intraoperative detection and eradication of residual microscopic foci, which exist in surgical margins, tumor invasion, and multifocal tumor spread. The GERTs feature gap-enhanced gold core-shell nanostructures, with Raman reporters embedding inside the interior gap junction. This nanostructure elicits highly sensitive and photostable Raman signals for microtumor detection by applying a 785 nm, low-energy laser and produces hyperthermia effects for microtumor ablation upon switching a 808 nm, high-power laser. In the orthotopic prostate metastasis tumor model, systematic delivery of GERTs enabled precise imaging and real-time ablation of macroscopic malignant lesions around the surgical bed without damaging normal tissues. Consequently, the GERTs-based surgery prevented local recurrence and delivered 100% tumor-free survival. These results suggest the efficiency of theranostic GERTs for precise detection and removal of residual miroctumors, broadening the avenues to apply Raman-based imaging for theranostic precision medicine.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Qiu, Yuanyuan","Zhang, Yuqing","Li, Mingwang","Chen, Gaoxian","Fan, Chenchen","Cui, Kai","Wan, Jian-Bo","Han, Anpan","Ye, Jian","Xiao, Zeyu"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-323010"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"corresponding_author":["Ye, Jian"],"country":["China","Macao"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Shanghai Jiao Tong University","University of Macau"],"keyword":["Cancer theranostics","Nanomedicine","Surface enhanced Raman spectroscopy"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"intraoperative detection and eradication of residual microtumors with gap enhanced raman tags","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85052319831","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-323010","identifier":[{"id":"30080395","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85052319831","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-3de08db3-479a-4206-be0b-36c919bda7af"],"keyword":["Cancer theranostics","Gap-enhanced Raman tag","Nanomedicine","Residual microtumors","Surface-enhanced Raman spectroscopy"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-F527F9233635C1EFAE356162880E4742"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"shanghai jiao tong university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Shanghai Jiao Tong University","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"mo","key":"university of macau","loc":["Macao","Asia, East"],"name":"University of Macau","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Center for Electron Nanoscopy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Yuanyuan","key":"qiupau","last":"Qiu","name":"Qiu, Yuanyuan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Yuqing","key":"zhangpau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Yuqing","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mingwang","key":