{"author_count":11,"contributors":["Huang, Xiao-Yan","Zhuang, Hong","Wu, Ji-Hong","Li, Jian-Kang","Hu, Fang-Yuan","Zheng, Yu","Tellier, Laurent Christian Asker M.","Zhang, Sheng-Hai","Gao, Feng-Juan","Zhang, Jian-Guo","Xu, Ge-Zhi"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-529839"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"targeted next generation sequencing analysis identifies novel mutations in families with severe familial exudative vitreoretinopathy","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/188444742/Huang_2017_Targeted_next_generation.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-529839","identifier":[{"id":"000408488900001","type":"wos"},{"id":"85028327629","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-e479e0ca-b65c-4959-933c-e84132cce309"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-82D7D71DD838AB8B46DA7EFD62043716"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/188444742/Huang_2017_Targeted_next_generation.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"rem","url":"http://www.molvis.org/molvis/v23/605/","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Xiao-Yan","key":"huangxiaoyanpau","last":"Huang","name":"Huang, Xiao-Yan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Hong","key":"zhuanghongpau","last":"Zhuang","name":"Zhuang, Hong","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Ji-Hong","key":"wujihongpau","last":"Wu","name":"Wu, Ji-Hong","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jian-Kang","key":"lijiankangpau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Jian-Kang","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Fang-Yuan","key":"hufangyuanpau","last":"Hu","name":"Hu, Fang-Yuan","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Yu","key":"zhengyupau","last":"Zheng","name":"Zheng, Yu","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Laurent Christian Asker M.","key":"tellierlaurentchristianaskermpau","last":"Tellier","name":"Tellier, Laurent Christian Asker M.","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Sheng-Hai","key":"zhangshenghaipau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Sheng-Hai","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Feng-Juan","key":"gaofengjuanpau","last":"Gao","name":"Gao, Feng-Juan","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jian-Guo","key":"zhangjianguopau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Jian-Guo","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Ge-Zhi","key":"xugezhipau","last":"Xu","name":"Xu, Ge-Zhi","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["10900535"],"journal":"Molecular Vision","pages":"605-613","status":"p","title":"Molecular Vision","volume":"23"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85028327629"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-e479e0ca-b65c-4959-933c-e84132cce309"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Targeted next-generation sequencing analysis identifies novel mutations in families with severe familial exudative vitreoretinopathy","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-529839","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"The discovery of new anode materials and engineering their fine structures are the core elements in the development of new-generation lithium ion batteries (LIBs). To this end, we herein report a novel nanostructured composite consisting of approximately 75% Fe3O4 nanorods and 25% reduced graphene oxide (rGO). Microscopy and spectroscopy analyses have identified that the Fe3O4 nanorods are wrapped (or encapsulated) by the rGO nanosheets via covalent bonding, which further self-assemble into a mesoporous hybrid composite networked by the graphene matrix. The composite has an average pore size around 20 nm and exhibits a high surface area of 152 m2 g−1, which is 76 times as high as that of conventional Fe3O4 powder. We have used the composite as an LIB anode material to fabricate coin-type prototype cells with lithium as the cathode. Systematic half-cell testing evaluations show that the electrochemical performance of the present composite material is amongst the best of the transition metal-oxide based LIB anode materials. The performances are characterized by a high reversible capacity of 1053 mA h g−1 subjected to 250 charge–discharge cycles at 500 mA g−1 and an excellent rate capability with the deliverable energy of 788–541 mA h g−1 upon the application of high current densities of 1000–5000 mA g−1. Overall, we have demonstrated that Fe3O4 nanorod–rGO hybrid composite is an interesting and promising material for the fabrication of LIB anodes.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Huang, Wei","Xiao, Xinxin","Engelbrekt, Christian","Zhang, Minwei","Li, Shuo","Ulstrup, Jens","Ci, Lijie","Feng, Jinkui","Si, Pengchao","Chi, Qijin"],"cuid":["S02-097.67-724236"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Asia, East"],"corresponding_author":["Si, Pengchao"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Key Laboratory for Liquid-Solid Structural Evolution and Processing of Materials","Shandong University"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"graphene encapsulated fe sub 000000000003 sub o sub 000000000004 sub nanorods assembled into a mesoporous hybrid composite used as a high performance lithium ion battery anode material","src":["aau","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85029319136&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["This study was sponsored by the National Natural Science Foundation of China (NSFC, No. 51301096), Shandong Provincial Natural Science Foundation (ZR2013EMQ012) and the Fundamental Research Funds of Shandong University (No. 2014JC017). The study was also financially supported by the Danish Council for Independent Research Technology and the Production Sciences (DEF-1335-00330) and the Danish Agency for Science, Technology and Innovation for the International Network Programme (4070-00131B). L. C. is grateful to the scientific exchange visit to DTU under the International Network Project, supported by the Danish Agency for Science, Technology and Innovation (Ref. No. 5132-00053B). Q. C. acknowledges the Danish Council for Independent Research DFF-FTP for a graphene-based project (Project No. 12-127447) and the Danish Agency for Science, Technology and Innovation for an International Network project (Ref. No. 5132-00053B). The authors wish to thank Prof. Jingdong Zhang for her support."],"id":"S02-097.67-724236","identifier":[{"id":"85035133944","type":"scopus"},{"id":"85029319136","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-8c3fb563-28af-4dcf-8bc7-ff2866c8f04f","dtu-2e773d1d-0bbc-45cc-ad97-5ff7362067a0"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-E20E67032393493EC1DF20F27C3C1078"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"shandong university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Shandong University","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience, Applied Supramolecular Chemistry","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience, Section for Chemical Science and Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"cn","key":"key laboratory for liquid solid structural evolution and processing of materials","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Key Laboratory for Liquid-Solid Structural Evolution and Processing of Materials","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Wei","key":"huangpau","last":"Huang","name":"Huang, Wei","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 3 4","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Xinxin","key":"xiaopau","last":"Xiao","locid":"fd69114c-9434-44ba-b01b-e9ecb3831cae","name":"Xiao, Xinxin","orcid":"0000-0002-0240-0038","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Christian","key":"engelbrektpau","last":"Engelbrekt","locid":"a1b586e6-3d4b-4ebc-9037-259adc94bc5a","name":"Engelbrekt, Christian","orcid":"0000-0003-3679-3666","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Minwei","key":"zhangpau","last":"Zhang","locid":"5ef56fa7-35c7-4c87-a634-99be40d0966f","name":"Zhang, Minwei","orcid":"0000-0001-5588-6169","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Shuo","key":"lipau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Shuo","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens","key":"ulstruppau","last":"Ulstrup","locid":"a7bf8f77-fd81-4dce-8592-8c7bec26750b","name":"Ulstrup, Jens","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lijie","key":"cipau","last":"Ci","name":"Ci, Lijie","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jinkui","key":"fengpau","last":"Feng","name":"Feng, Jinkui","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Pengchao","key":"sipau","last":"Si","name":"Si, Pengchao","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Qijin","key":"chipau","last":"Chi","locid":"58814d81-9a77-4b0b-846a-7df57b1fed32","name":"Chi, Qijin","orcid":"0000-0003-4523-2609","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1039/c6qm00252h","issn":["20521537"],"issue":"6","journal":"Materials Chemistry Frontiers","pages":"1185-1193","publisher":"Royal Society of Chemistry","status":"p","title":"Materials Chemistry Frontiers","volume":"1"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85029319136"],"sdg":["7. Affordable and Clean Energy","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-8c3fb563-28af-4dcf-8bc7-ff2866c8f04f","dtu-2e773d1d-0bbc-45cc-ad97-5ff7362067a0"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Graphene encapsulated Fe<sub>3</sub>O<sub>4</sub> nanorods assembled into a mesoporous hybrid composite used as a high-performance lithium-ion battery anode material","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-097.67-724236","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"Due to strong mode-confinement, long propagation-distance, and unique tunability, graphene plasmons have been widely explored in the mid-infrared and terahertz windows. However, it remains a big challenge to push graphene plasmons to shorter wavelengths in order to integrate graphene plasmon concepts with existing mature technologies in the near-infrared region. We investigate localized graphene plasmons supported by graphene nanodisks and experimentally demonstrated graphene plasmon working at 2 μm with the aid of a fully scalable block copolymer selfassembly method. Our results show a promising way to promote graphene plasmons for both fundamental studies and potential applications in the near-infrared window.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Wang, Zhongli","Li, Tao","Almdal, Kristoffer","Xiao, Sanshui","Mortensen, N. Asger","Ndoni, Sokol"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-036179"],"event":{"end":"2017-03-31","place":"Barcelona, es","start":"2017-03-28","title":"Graphene 2017","year":"2017"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"nanostructures graphene plasmon works close to near infrared window","src":["dtu","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/124630919/Grapheneconf2017_Wang_Zhongli.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-036179","ids":["dtu-9e068011-ad01-4304-9b31-096a6fc2482e","sdu-ecf19dbd-a84c-4a19-ab40-bbbb5ffb7c96"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-4F186CA90C2F80B6846213D04BCC0FAD"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/124630919/Grapheneconf2017_Wang_Zhongli.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/131182986/Grapheneconf2017_Wang_Zhongli.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Micro- and Nanotechnology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Micro- and Nanotechnology, Self-Organized Nanoporous Materials"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":2,"key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, Faculty of Science, Danish Institute for Advanced Study"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU"}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Zhongli","key":"wangpau","last":"Wang","locid":"e03185f1-ee58-4d68-b502-389ba3d77b3a","name":"Wang, Zhongli","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Tao","key":"lipau","last":"Li","locid":"fbb38a0d-283c-4595-ad95-9909a4c81844","name":"Li, Tao","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kristoffer","key":"almdalpau","last":"Almdal","locid":"f7ff938f-94fe-4584-b751-cd218de29a0c","name":"Almdal, Kristoffer","orcid":"0000-0002-5490-9303","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sanshui","key":"xiaopau","last":"Xiao","locid":"c516dded-c5eb-40a6-b2dd-37be55b893c8","name":"Xiao, Sanshui","orcid":"0000-0001-6529-5047","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"N. Asger","key":"mortensenpau","last":"Mortensen","locid":"85da0775-0beb-47f2-8cc6-ea4eb9fcad2d","name":"Mortensen, N. Asger","orcid":"0000-0001-7936-6264","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Sokol","key":"ndonipau","last":"Ndoni","locid":"d425701a-23e9-4d32-a6f2-d1db3114605f","name":"Ndoni, Sokol","orcid":"0000-0002-6854-1909","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-9e068011-ad01-4304-9b31-096a6fc2482e","sdu-ecf19dbd-a84c-4a19-ab40-bbbb5ffb7c96"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Nanostructures graphene plasmon works close to near-infrared window","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-036179","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"Staphylococcus aureus (S. aureus) is problematic for lactating mammals and public health. Understanding of mechanisms by which the hosts respond to severe invasion of S. aureus remains elusive. In this study, the genome-wide expression of mRNAs and miRNAs in bovine mammary gland cells were interrogated at 24 h after intra-mammary infection (IMI) with high or low concentrations of S. aureus. Compared to the negative control quarters, 194 highly-confident responsive genes were identified in the quarters with high concentration (109 cfu/mL) of S. aureus, which were predominantly implicated in pathways and biological processes pertaining to innate immune system, such as cytokine-cytokine receptor interaction and inflammatory response. In contrast, only 21 highly-confident genes were significantly differentially expressed in face of low concentration (106 cfu/mL) of S. aureus, which slightly perturbed the cell signaling and invoked corresponding responses like vasoconstriction, indicating limited perturbations and immunological evading. Additionally, the significant up-regulations of bta-mir-223 and bta-mir-21-3p were observed in the quarters infected by high concentration of S. aureus. Network analysis suggested that the two miRNAs' pivotal roles in defending hosts against bacterial infection probably through inhibiting CXCL14 and KIT. The significant down-regulation of CXCL14 was also observed in bovine mammary epithelial cells at 24 h post-infection of S. aureus (108 cfu/mL) in vitro. Integrated analysis with QTL database further suggested 28 genes (e.g., CXCL14, KIT, and SLC4A11) as candidates of bovine mastitis. This study first systematically revealed transcriptional and post-transcriptional responses of bovine mammary gland cells to invading S. aureus in a dosage-dependent pattern, and highlighted a complicated responsive mechanism in a network of miRNA-gene-pathway interplay.","author_count":13,"contributors":["Fang, Lingzhao","Hou, Yali","An, Jing","Li, Bingjie","Song, Minyan","Wang, Xiao","Sørensen, Peter","Dong, Yichun","Liu, Chao","Wang, Yachun","Zhu, Huabin","Zhang, Shengli","Yu, Ying"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-163195"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"corresponding_author":["Yu, Ying"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","China Agricultural University","Chinese Academy of Agricultural Sciences","Chinese Academy of Sciences"],"keyword":["Bovine mastitis","Innate immune responses","Staphylococcus aureus","Transcriptome"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"genome wide transcriptional and post transcriptional regulation of innate immune and defense responses of bovine mammary gland to staphylococcus aureus","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3389/fcimb.2016.00193","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-163195","identifier":[{"id":"85009799121","type":"scopus"},{"id":"28083515","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC5183581","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["au-3b5ff1ab-80b5-42a9-a153-bdf24a2d1ef1"],"keyword":["Bovine mastitis","Innate immune responses","MiRNAome","Staphylococcus aureus","Transcriptome"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-28A4870DBE5A3AA531F053C0DE687501"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3389/fcimb.2016.00193","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC5183581/pdf/fcimb-06-00193.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"af