ecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Francisco","key":"guarnerfranciscopau","last":"Guarner","name":"Guarner, Francisco","rank":32,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","first":"Oluf","key":"pedersenolufpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"0a2a7ad3-1719-43c6-bdf3-c3491a43a8af","name":"Pedersen, Oluf","orcid":"0000-0002-3321-3972","rank":33,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Joel","key":"doréjoelpau","last":"Doré","name":"Doré, Joel","rank":34,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"S Dusko","key":"ehrlichsduskopau","last":"Ehrlich","name":"Ehrlich, S Dusko","rank":35,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Peer","key":"borkpeerpau","last":"Bork","name":"Bork, Peer","rank":36,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","first":"Jun","key":"wangjunpau","last":"Wang","locid":"5dee6edc-2876-496f-a341-4a07933f9928","name":"Wang, Jun","rank":37,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["24997786"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1038/nbt.2942","issn":["10870156","15461696"],"issn_org":["10870156"],"issue":"8","journal":"Nature Biotechnology","pages":"834-841","publisher":"Nature Research","status":"p","title":"Nature Biotechnology","volume":"32"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84905730165"],"sdg":["3. Good Health and Well-being","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Undetermined","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-f0604914-10d7-432a-bc84-36c9b615d4ab","ku-b39d4a15-c465-428e-828b-3915444cbb14"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"An integrated catalog of reference genes in the human gut microbiome","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-089.66-037944","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Nanoporous gold (NPG) is composed of three-dimensional (3D) bicontinuous nanostructures with large surface area. Nano-channels inside NPG provide an ideal local environment for immobilization of enzyme molecules with expected stabilization of the protein molecules. In this work, glucose oxidase (GOx) has been brought to assemble on NPG via surface chemical reactions to form enzyme modified NPG nanomaterial with promising sensitivity for glucose detection. Cyclic voltammetry and single-potential step chronoamperometry (SPSC) are employed to study the electrochemical behavior of both bare and enzyme-modified NPG. Two redox mediators, p-benzoquinone (BQ) and ferrocenecarboxylic acid (FCA) are used to shuttle electrons between the enzyme redox center inside of GOx and the NPG electrode. Diffusion patterns at the functionalized NPG electrode are found significantly different from those on planar gold electrodes. This is mainly caused by internal 3D single crystal-like structures of NPG. Electrostatically neutral BQ mediator gives much higher voltammetric sensitivity than negatively charged FCA for GOx modified NPG electrodes.This study provides insight into the understanding of the intrinsic properties of NPG materials aiming at evolving enzymatic biosensors with high performance. © 2014 Elsevier Ltd.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Xiao, Xinxin","Ulstrup, Jens","Li, Hui","Wang, Meng'En","Zhang, Jingdong","Si, Pengchao"],"cuid":["S02-099.77-724192"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Asia, East"],"corresponding_author":["Zhang, Jingdong"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Key Laboratory for Liquid-Solid Structural Evolution and Processing of Materials","Shandong University"],"keyword":["Chronoamperometry","Cyclic voltammetry","Electrochemical biosensing","Electrochemical biosensor","Electrochemical biosensors","Electron transfer","Enzyme electrodes","Enzyme immobilization","Glucose oxidase","Glucose sensors","Gold","Materials properties","Molecules","Nanoporous gold","Self assembled monolayers","Self assembled monolayers Electron transfer","Three dimensional"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"nanoporous gold assembly of glucose oxidase for electrochemical biosensing","src":["aau","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.electacta.2014.02.146","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["This work was supported by the National Natural Science Foundation of China (NSFC, No.51301096), the National 973 (2012CB932800) Program Project of China, Shandong Provincial Natural Science Foundation (ZR2013EMQ012), Project No.31370056431211 and No.31370070614018(2010TB018) from Shandong University to PS and Lundbeck (R141-2013-13273) to JZ. We appreciate the kind support and meaningful discussion with Prof. Yi Ding and his group members."],"id":"S02-099.77-724192","identifier":[{"id":"84898636225","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-6d0df26b-fa06-42a7-820e-638fc28ac0e8","dtu-94ff74db-601d-4bc6-9193-e91f791b5128"],"keyword":["Chronoamperometry","Cyclic voltammetry","Electrochemical behaviors","Electrochemical biosensing","Electrochemical biosensor","Electrochemical biosensors","Electron transfer","Enzyme electrodes","Enzyme immobilization","Glucose oxidase","Glucose sensors","Gold","Materials properties","Molecules","Nanoporous gold","Planar gold electrodes","Self assembled monolayers","Self-assembled monolayers, Electron transfer","Surface chemical reactions","Three dimensional","Voltammetric sensitivity"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-18A421B901394F8D70CDFA19CB76FD18"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.electacta.2014.02.146","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience, Applied Supramolecular Chemistry","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience, Section for Chemical Science and Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"cn","key":"key laboratory for liquid solid structural evolution and processing of materials","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Key Laboratory for Liquid-Solid Structural Evolution and Processing of Materials","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"cn","key":"shandong university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Shandong University","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemistry","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemistry, NanoChemistry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2 3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Xinxin","key":"xiaopau","last":"Xiao","locid":"fd69114c-9434-44ba-b01b-e9ecb3831cae","name":"Xiao, Xinxin","orcid":"0000-0002-0240-0038","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens","key":"ulstruppau","last":"Ulstrup","locid":"a7bf8f77-fd81-4dce-8592-8c7bec26750b","name":"Ulstrup, Jens","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3 1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hui","key":"lipau","last":"Li","locid":"25b7eb5d-9574-415a-a631-fd2e5d7f547f","name":"Li, Hui","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Meng'En","key":"wangpau","last":"Wang","name":"Wang, Meng'En","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jingdong","key":"zhangpau","last":"Zhang","locid":"4ad653c4-dedf-4da4-9808-9d4be7846db0","name":"Zhang, Jingdong","orcid":"0000-0002-0889-7057","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Pengchao","key":"sipau","last":"Si","name":"Si, Pengchao","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.electacta.2014.02.146","issn":["00134686","18733859"],"issn_org":["00134686"],"journal":"Electrochimica Acta","pages":"559-567","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Electrochimica Acta","volume":"130"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84898636225"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-6d0df26b-fa06-42a7-820e-638fc28ac0e8","dtu-94ff74db-601d-4bc6-9193-e91f791b5128"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Nanoporous gold assembly of glucose oxidase for electrochemical biosensing","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-099.77-724192","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Purpose:  To examine retinal and choroidal blood vessels using spectral-domain optical coherence tomography (SD-OCT). Methods:  Retrospective case series. Results:  Scans through retinal blood vessels in healthy subjects demonstrated vessel wall reflexes and a tri-layer profile of the blood column on longitudinal scans and a figure-of-eight configuration on cross-sectional scans. Intravascular reflectivity decreased with increasingly oblique angles of observation and was absent when blood flow was parallel to the line of sight. The high blood flow in the choroidal vessels in healthy subjects and the low flow in the retinal vessels in patients with ocular ischaemic syndrome and central retinal artery occlusion were both associated with lower reflectivity of the blood and an unstructured intravascular SD-OCT profile. Discussion:  This qualitative in vivo study found a characteristically structured SD-OCT profile of the blood column in retinal vessels with normal blood flow. Both structure and total reflectivity faded when blood flow was lower or higher than normal or at oblique angles to the line of sight. In conclusion, SD-OCT scans of the vessels in the posterior pole of the eye may assist the clinical assessment of gross abnormalities of ocular blood flow, e.g. in carotid artery stenosis.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Willerslev, Anne","Li, Xiao Qiang","Cordtz, Peter","Munch, Inger C","Larsen, Michael"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-433999"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"retinal and choroidal intravascular spectral domain optical coherence tomography","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/aos.12048","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-433999","identifier":[{"id":"84896723226","type":"scopus"},{"id":"23552098","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-43ea5b24-c891-49ce-8926-4ba8c74f7415"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D95EE921EBC96BE5680F1491569D99E3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/aos.12048","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Section of Neurology, Psychiatry and Sensory Sciences"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Anne","key":"willerslevpau","last":"Willerslev","name":"Willerslev, Anne","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Xiao Qiang","key":"lipau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Xiao Qiang","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Peter","key":"cordtzpau","last":"Cordtz","name":"Cordtz, Peter","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Inger C","key":"munchpau","last":"Munch","name":"Munch, Inger C","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Michael","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"1d460214-c0db-4a15-a3a5-360c73746ed4","name":"Larsen, Michael","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["23552098"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/aos.12048","issn":["17553768"],"issue":"2","journal":"Acta Ophthamologica","status":"p","title":"Acta Ophthamologica","title_org":"Acta Ophthalmologica (Online)","volume":"92"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoI