{"abstract":"Nanoporous gold (NPG) based biosensors have been constructed by covalently immobilizing glucose oxidase (GOx) onto self-assembled monolayers (SAMs). With p-benzoquinone (BQ) as a mediator, diffusion behavior and amperometric biosensor performance are evaluated by electrochemical characterization. The enzyme modified electrodes are demonstrated to show a thickness-sensitive behavior. Compared with planar polycrystalline gold, the unique porous structure of NPG has also been characterized via an electrochemical surface reconstruction process. Single-crystal gold-like electrochemical behavior on NPG and a comprehensive understanding of its impacts on sensor performance have been proposed.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Xiao, Xinxin","Li, Hui","Wang, Meng’en","Zhang, Kai","Si, Pengchao"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-725628"],"filters":{"added":"2024-05","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"corresponding_author":["Si, Pengchao"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Key Laboratory for Liquid-Solid Structural Evolution and Processing of Materials","Shandong University"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"examining the effects of self assembled monolayers on nanoporous gold based amperometric glucose biosensors","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=84890012018&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-725628","identifier":[{"id":"24256634","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84890012018","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-3f45a0bf-7e7b-4c0d-8899-cc22c71d10b7"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-E991EAAE5C6897CC57CFA84F6742E9E3"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience, Applied Supramolecular Chemistry","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience, Section for Chemical Science and Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"cn","key":"key laboratory for liquid solid structural evolution and processing of materials","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Key Laboratory for Liquid-Solid Structural Evolution and Processing of Materials","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"cn","key":"shandong university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Shandong University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2 3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Xinxin","key":"xiaopau","last":"Xiao","locid":"fd69114c-9434-44ba-b01b-e9ecb3831cae","name":"Xiao, Xinxin","orcid":"0000-0002-0240-0038","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3 1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hui","key":"lipau","last":"Li","locid":"25b7eb5d-9574-415a-a631-fd2e5d7f547f","name":"Li, Hui","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Meng’en","key":"wangpau","last":"Wang","name":"Wang, Meng’en","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Kai","key":"zhangpau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Kai","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Pengchao","key":"sipau","last":"Si","name":"Si, Pengchao","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["24256634"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1039/c3an01670f","issn":["00032654","13645528"],"i