illeux, Richard E","rank":40,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Merideth","key":"bonierbalemeridethpau","last":"Bonierbale","name":"Bonierbale, Merideth","rank":41,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Jeanne M E","key":"jacobsjeannemepau","last":"Jacobs","name":"Jacobs, Jeanne M E","rank":42,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Dan","key":"milbournedanpau","last":"Milbourne","name":"Milbourne, Dan","rank":43,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"David Michael Alan","key":"martindavidmichaelalanpau","last":"Martin","name":"Martin, David Michael Alan","rank":44,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Glenn J","key":"bryanglennjpau","last":"Bryan","name":"Bryan, Glenn J","rank":45,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["24062527"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1534/g3.113.007153","issn":["21601836"],"issue":"11","journal":"G3: Genes, Genomes, Genetics","pages":"2031-2047","publisher":"Genetics Society of America","status":"p","title":"G3: Genes, Genomes, Genetics","title_org":"G3: Genes, Genomes, Genetics (Bethesda)","volume":"3"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84889019837"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-81f090e0-8e52-4866-b964-5e2f9739960b"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Construction of Reference Chromosome-Scale Pseudomolecules for Potato : Integrating the Potato Genome with Genetic and Physical Maps","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-087830","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"Duodenal epithelial cells need efficient defence strategies during gastric acidity in the lumen, while colonic mucosa counteracts damage by pathogens through the build-up of a bacteria-free adherent mucus layer. HCO(3)(-) transport is considered crucial for duodenal defence against acid as well as for mucus release and expansion, but the involved transport pathways are incompletely understood. This study investigated the significance of the electroneutral Na(+)HCO(3)(-) cotransporter NBCn1 for duodenal defence against acid and colonic mucus release. NBCn1 was localised to the basolateral membrane of duodenal villous enterocytes and of colonic crypt cells with a goblet cell predominant expression. Duodenal villous enterocyte pHi was studied before and during a luminal acid load by two-photon microscopy in exteriorised, vascularly perfused, indicator (SNARF-1 AM)-loaded duodenum of isoflurane-anaesthetised, systemic acid/base controlled mice. Acid-induced HCO(3)(-) secretion was measured in vivo by single-pass perfusion and pH-stat titration. After a luminal acid load, NBCn1-deficient duodenocytes were unable to rapidly recover from intracellular acidification and could not adequately respond with a protective HCO(3)(-) secretory response. In the colon, mucus layer build-up was delayed, and a decreased thickness of the adherent mucus layer was observed, suggesting that basolateral HCO(3)(-) uptake is essential for optimal mucus release. The electroneutral Na(+)HCO(3)(-) cotransporter NBCn1 displays a differential cellular distribution in the murine intestine and is essential for HCO(3)(-)-dependent mucosal protective functions such as pHi-recovery and HCO(3)(-) secretion in the duodenum and mucus secretion in the colon.","author_count":13,"contributors":["Singh, Anurag Kumar","Xia, Weiliang","Riederer, Brigitte","Juric, Marina","Li, Junhua","Zheng, Wen","Cinar, Ayhan","Xiao, Fang","Bachmann, Oliver","Song, Penghong","Praetorius, Jeppe","Aalkjær, Christian","Seidler, Ursula"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-164354"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"essential role of the electroneutral na hco000000000003 cotransporter nbcn000000000001 in murine duodenal acid base balance and colonic mucus layer build up in vivo","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1113/jphysiol.2012.247874","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-164354","identifier":[{"id":"23401617","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84876311710","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC3634528","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["au-3d76fea4-ef63-4eb1-818a-8953c992acf0"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-B99CE0511A5354B8ACAB126355D20959"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1113/jphysiol.2012.247874","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Biomedicine, Department of Biomedicine - Forskning og uddannelse, Syd"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Anurag Kumar","key":"singhpau","last":"Singh","name":"Singh, Anurag Kumar","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Weiliang","key":"xiapau","last":"Xia","name":"Xia, Weiliang","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Brigitte","key":"riedererpau","last":"Riederer","name":"Riederer, Brigitte","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Marina","key":"juricpau","last":"Juric","name":"Juric, Marina","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Junhua","key":"lipau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Junhua","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Wen","key":"zhengpau","last":"Zheng","name":"Zheng, Wen","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Ayhan","key":"cinarpau","last":"Cinar","name":"Cinar, Ayhan","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Fang","key":"xiaopau","last":"Xiao","name":"Xiao, Fang","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Oliver","key":"bachmannpau","last":"Bachmann","name":"Bachmann, Oliver","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Penghong","key":"songpau","last":"Song","name":"Song, Penghong","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jeppe","key":"prætoriuspau","last":"Prætorius","locid":"77279423-f4c7-4cc0-9c81-1dbf96fd08c1","name":"Praetorius, Jeppe","name_org":"Prætorius, Jeppe","orcid":"0000-0001-6109-247X","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian","key":"aalkjaerpau","last":"Aalkjaer","locid":"5432bf4e-2402-4f9d-9c5b-d44af26ac406","name":"Aalkjær, Christian","name_org":"Aalkjaer, Christian","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Ursula","key":"seidlerpau","last":"Seidler","name":"Seidler, Ursula","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["23401617"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1113/jphysiol.2012.247874","issn":["00223751","14697793"],"issn_org":["00223751"],"issue":"8","journal":"Journal of Physiology","pages":"2189-2204","publisher":"John Wiley & Sons Inc.","status":"p","title":"Journal of Physiology","title_org":"The Journal of Physiology","volume":"591"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84876311710"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-3d76fea4-ef63-4eb1-818a-8953c992acf0"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Essential role of the electroneutral Na+HCO3- cotransporter NBCn1 in murine duodenal acid/base balance and colonic mucus layer build-up in vivo","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-164354","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"Non-precious metal catalysts (NPMCs) for the oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) are an active subject of recent research on proton exchange membrane fuel cells. In this study, we report a new approach to preparation of self-supported and nano-structured NPMCs using pre-prepared polyaniline (PANI) nanofibers as both nitrogen and carbon precursors. The synthesized NPMCs possess nanoworm structures preserved from the PANI precursor and exhibit high onset potential of 0.905 V vs. RHE and selective activity of nearly four-electron ORR pathways. A significant enhancement in the intrinsic activity and onset potential for the ORR is observed when the Fe content in the precursor is increased from 0 to 3.0 wt.%, while further addition to 10.0 wt.% results in a decrease in the catalytic activity.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Hu, Yang","Zhao, Xiao","Huang, Yunjie","Li, Qingfeng","Bjerrum, Niels J.","Liu, Changpeng","Xing, Wei"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-311117"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","CAS - Changchun Institute of Applied Chemistry"],"keyword":["Active site","Activity","Heat treatment","Non precious metal catalyst","Oxygen reduction reaction"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"synthesis of self supported non precious metal catalysts for oxygen reduction reaction with preserved nanostructures from the polyaniline nanofiber precursor","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpowsour.2012.10.013","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-311117","identifier":[{"id":"84868320658","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-15b4c176-3823-48f4-b7ef-8f7dd784355d"],"keyword":["Active site","Activity","Heat-treatment","Non-precious metal catalyst","Oxygen reduction reaction"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-44D8F75E3385786FD5CCC023214C850D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpowsour.2012.10.013","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"cas changchun institute of applied chemistry","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"CAS - Changchun Institute of Applied Chemistry","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Energy Conversion and Storage","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Energy Conversion and Storage, Proton conductors"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Yang","key":"hupau","last":"Hu","name":"Hu, Yang","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Xiao","key":"zhaopau","last":"Zhao","name":"Zhao, Xiao","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Yunjie","key":"huangpau","last":"Huang","locid":"0023cb27-62e4-4edf-962f-912b0373f54e","name":"Huang, Yunjie","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Qingfeng","key":"lipau","last":"Li","locid":"905a9410-e476-40fa-b8b5-2c0430d86608","name":"Li, Qingfeng","orcid":"0000-0002-5460-055X","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Niels J.","key":"bjerrumpau","last":"Bjerrum","locid":"757b6ca7-7e5e-44fa-8a23-dd3d3cc8959c","name":"Bjerrum, Niels J.","orcid":"0000-0001-7241-4091","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Changpeng","key":"liupau","last":"Liu","name":"Liu, Changpeng","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Wei","key":"xingpau","last":"Xing","name":"Xing, Wei","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.jpowsour.2012.10.013","issn":["03787753","18732755"],"issn_org":["03787753"],"journal":"Journal of Power Sources","pages":"129-136","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Journal of Power Sources","volume":"225"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84868320658"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-15b4c176-3823-48f4-b7ef-8f7dd784355d"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Synthesis of self-supported non-precious metal catalysts for oxygen reduction reaction with preserved nanostructures from the polyaniline nanofiber precursor","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-311117","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"Efforts to extract a Greenland ice core with a complete record of the Eemian interglacial (130,000 to 115,000 years ago) have until now been unsuccessful. The response of the Greenland ice sheet to the warmer-than-present climate of the Eemian has thus remained unclear. Here we present the new North Greenland Eemian Ice Drilling ('NEEM') ice core and show only a modest ice-sheet response to the strong warming in the early Eemian. We reconstructed the Eemian record from folded ice using globally homogeneous parameters known from dated Greenland and Antarctic ice-core records. On the basis of water stable isotopes, NEEM surface temperatures after the onset of the Eemian (126,000 years ago) peaked at 8 ± 4 degrees Celsius above the mean of the past millennium, followed by a gradual cooling that was probably driven by the decreasing summer insolation. Between 128,000 and 122,000 years ago, the thickness of the northwest Greenland ice sheet decreased by 400 ± 250 metres, reaching surface elevations 122,000 years ago of 130 ± 300 metres lower than the present. Extensive surface melt occurred at the NEEM site during the Eemian, a phenomenon witnessed when melt layers formed again at NEEM during the exceptional heat of July 2012. With additional warming, surface melt might become more common in the future.","author_count":133,"contributors":["Dahl-Jensen, Dorthe","Albert, M. R.","Aldahan, A.","Azuma, N.","Balslev-Clausen, David Morten","Baumgartner, M.","Berggren, A.-M.","Bigler, M.","Binder, Thomas","Blunier, Thomas","Bourgeois, J.C.","Brook, E.J.","Buchardt, Susanne Lilja","Buizert, Christo","Capron, E.","Chappellaz, J.","Chung, J.","Clausen, Henrik Brink","Cvijanovic, Ivana","Davies, S.M.","Ditlevsen, Peter","Eicher, O.","Fischer, H.","Fisher, D. A.","Fleet, L.G.","Gfeller, G.","Gkinis, Vasileios","Gogineni, S.","Goto-Azuma, K.","Grinsted, Aslak","Gudlaugsdottir, H.","Guillevic, Myriam","Hansen, S. B.","Hansson, M.","Hirabayashi, M.","Hong, S.","Hur, S.D.","Huybrechts, P.","Hvidberg, Christine S.","Iizuka, Y.","Jenk, Theo Manuel","Johnsen, Sigfus Johann","Jones, T.R.","Jouzel, J.","Karlsson, Nanna Bjørnholt","Kawamura, K.","Keegan, K.","Kettner, Ernesto","Kipfstuhl, S.","Kjær, Helle Astrid","Koutnik, M.","Kuramoto, T.","Köhler, P.","Laepple, T.","Landais, A.","Langen, Peter Lang","Larsen, Lars Berg","Leuenberger, D.","Leuenberger, M.","Leuschen, C.","Li, J.","Lipenkov, V.","Martinerie, P.","Maselli, O. J.","Masson-Delmotte, V.","McConnell, J. R.","Miller, H.","Mini, O.","Miyamoto, A.","Montagnat-Rentier, M.","Mulvaney, R.","Muscheler, R.","Orsi, A.J.","Paden, J.","Panton, Christian","Pattyn, F.","Petit, J.-R.","Pol, K.","Popp, Trevor James","Possnert, G.","Prié, F.","Prokopiou, M.","Quiquet, A.","Rasmussen, Sune Olander","Raynaud, D.","Ren, J.","Reutenauer, Corentin","Ritz, C.","Röckmann, T.","Rosen, J.L.","Rubino, Mauro","Rybak, O.","Samyn, D.","Sapart, C.J.","Schilt, A.","Schmidt, Astrid Mariah Zelma","Schwander, J.","Schüpbach, S.","Seierstad, Inger Kathrine","Severinghaus, J. P.","Sheldon, S.","Simonsen, Sebastian Bjerregaard","Sjolte, Jesper","Solgaard, Anne Munck","Sowers, T.","Sperlich, Peter","Steen-Larsen, Hans Christian","Steffen, K.","Steffensen, Jørgen Peder","Steinhage, D.","Stocker, T.F.","Stowasser, Christopher","Sturevik, A.S.","Sturges, W.T.","Sveinbjörnsdottir, A.","Svensson, Anders","Tison, J.-L.","Uetake, J.","Vallelonga, Paul","Van De Wal, R.S.W.","Van Der Wel, G.","Vaughn, B.H.","Vinther, Bo Møllesøe","Waddington, E.","Wegner, A.","Weikusat, I.","White, J. W. C.","Wilhelms, F.","Winstrup, Mai","Witrant, E.","Wolff, E.W.","Xiao, C.","Zheng, Jin"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-409200"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"51-200 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Asia, East","Asia, Middle East","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Belgium","Canada","China","France","Germany","Iceland","Japan","Netherlands","Russia","South Korea"