351016","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"We have numerically proved that the dependence of AC susceptibility χ of a E(J) power law superconducting thin disc on many parameters can be reduced to one penetration parameter h, with E the electric field and J the current density. Based on this result, we propose a way of measuring the critical current density Jc of superconducting thin films by AC susceptibility. Compared with the normally used method based on the peak of the imaginary part, our method uses a much larger range of the AC susceptibility curve, thus allowing determination of the temperature (T) dependence of Jc from a normally applied χ(T) measurement. A fitting equation Jc=1.9Ha∣χ′∣0.69/d, −0.4","author_count":4,"contributors":["Li, Xiao-Fen","Grivel, Jean-Claude","Abrahamsen, Asger Bech","Andersen, Niels Hessel"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-371355"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Critical current density"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"critical current density measurement of thin films by ac susceptibility based on the penetration parameter em h em","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.physc.2012.02.032","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-371355","identifier":[{"id":"84860295439","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-df532a6d-0733-45c1-b192-901f12da32e9"],"keyword":["AC susceptibility","Critical current density","London penetration depth","Superconducting thin film"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-B9655635619E3983F060C32BA98889E1"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.physc.2012.02.032","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Energy Conversion and Storage","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Energy Conversion and Storage, Electrofunctional materials"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Xiao-Fen","key":"lipau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Xiao-Fen","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jean-Claude","key":"grivelpau","last":"Grivel","locid":"51bcc82e-b9b4-4ef6-ac20-92431097c3cc","name":"Grivel, Jean-Claude","orcid":"0000-0001-7835-9054","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Asger B.","key":"abrahamsenpau","last":"Abrahamsen","locid":"adb135d1-80a7-4b9d-a28d-a832010667f8","name":"Abrahamsen, Asger Bech","name_org":"Abrahamsen, Asger B.","orcid":"0000-0002-1556-3565","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Niels Hessel","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"51dee171-cbe5-4da7-91bf-47a39e0a552e","name":"Andersen, Niels Hessel","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.physc.2012.02.032","issn":["09214534","18732143"],"issn_org":["09214534"],"journal":"Physica C: Superconductivity and its Applications","pages":"6-14","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Physica C: Superconductivity and its Applications","volume":"477"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84860295439"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-df532a6d-0733-45c1-b192-901f12da32e9"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Critical current density measurement of thin films by AC susceptibility based on the penetration parameter <em>h</em>","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-371355","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
